 their striking appearance. The stainless steel construction guarantees longevity and enhances the pipes’ resistance to corrosion and heat, making them a reliable addition to your Royal Enfield. Product Highlights: Performance Unleashed: Our Header Pipes redefine your bike’s potential, delivering an impressive surge in torque and horsepower, translating to an exhilarating riding experience. Unrestricted Flow: The free-flow design optimizes exhaust gas movement, improving engine efficiency and enhancing overall performance. Stainless Steel Strength: Crafted from high-grade stainless steel, our Header Pipes combine strength, corrosion resistance, and heat resilience for lasting performance and aesthetics. Precision Engineering: Designed to fit the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT seamlessly, our Header Pipes guarantee a hassle-free installation process. Upgrade your ride with our Stainless Steel Header Pipes, a testament to our commitment to engineering excellence and performance enhancement. Experience the thrill of unrestricted power and transform your Royal Enfield into a force to be reckoned with. Don’t just ride – command the road. Upgrade today and witness the true potential of your bike. Disclaimer: Due to extended use and exposure to great engine temperatures, it is normal for the exhaust to gain a faint golden tint. Compatible with: Royal Enfield Himalayan and Scram 411. What you get: 1 No.s Header pipe, Keychain, Sticker, and Manual. Additional Information:- Weight (Kg) Length (cm) Breadth (cm) Height (cm) 8 80 45 2051:T537,About Red Rooster Rumbler Ace–Polish Exhaust for RE Meteor 350 Introducing the Red Rooster Performance Rumbler Ace Exhaust in a striking Chrome (Polish) finish, specially crafted to elevate your Royal Enfield biking experience. Meticulously designed and rigorously tested, this exhaust ensures a seamless flow, granting your bike a remarkable 20% boost in performance. Crafted from top-tier SS304 stainless steel, this exhaust guarantees unmatched durability and rust-free performance. Say goodbye to the limitations of traditional glass wool, as the Red Rooster Rumbler Ace boasts ceramic wool, offering superior thermal resistance for an unparalleled riding experience. With a lifetime material warranty, you can ride with complete peace of mind. Upgrade your bike’s performance and style by swapping out your factory exhaust with the Red Rooster Performance Rumbler Ace. Get ready to revel in exhilarating rides like never before and immerse yourself in the authentic Royal Enfield thump with every rev as the Red Rooster Rumbler Ace enhances the iconic sound you love. Compatible with: Compatible with: Royal Enfield Classic Reborn 350/500 (post-2021 model) and Meteor 350. What you get: 1 silencer, Clamps, Stickers, Keychains, and a Manual. Additional Information:- Weight (Kg) Length (cm) Breadth (cm) Height (cm) 5 74 17 2052:T5c6,New Te203 Performace Exhaust For Shot Gun - Black The AEW TE 203- the latest addition to the AEW SHOTGUN 650 range Designed to look retro. It comes with a heat shield to conceal the silencer mounts for an even more enhanced look. Fabricated from high-quality stainless steel, the TE 203 comes heat resistance black coated with lightweight sound-damping insulation. This exhaust has the added benefit of reducing bike weight by 6 kgs and provides better bottom and mid-range torque. Thanks to its slip-on mounting capability, the TE 203 is a direct, easy fit. Styling of the bike improves thanks to a slimmer look, compared to the original. A highlight of the TE 203 is its signature rumble, which you can’t miss whenever downshifting through the gearbox, or under braking. TE 203 comes with a lifetime warranty against rusting and an easily removable, stainless steel decibel (DB) killer. ADDITIONAL INFORMATION Weight 6 kg Dimensions 57 × 26 × 13 cm Finish Stainless Steel Heat Resistance Black Note: AEW Product Availability \\u0026 Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-930072078953:T427,AEW Edge Free Flow Exhaust For Himalayan 450 / Guerrilla 450 The new AEW EDGE for Himalayan 450 / Guerrilla 450 is a free-flow, slip-on exhaust system that has been painstakingly crafted and engineered to perfectly match Royal Enfield’s Himalayan 450 / Guerrilla 450 Adventure bike. The exhaust provides the bike with a medium-tone thump and increased bottom to mid-range performance at the throttle. Designed to enhance the look of your Himalayan 450 / Guerrilla 450. The AEW EDGE for Himalayan 450 / Guerrilla 450 is available in 304-grade stainless steel matt polish. Weight 2 kg Note: AEW Product Availability \\u0026 Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-930072078954:T5da,About Red Rooster Astral Exhaust for RE Shotgun 650 - Polish Introducing the Red Rooster Performance Astral Chrome (Polish) Exhaust – the perfect match for Royal Enfield’s Shotgun 650. Elevate your riding experience with this extraordinary exhaust designed to bring out the true essence of cruising. Crafted with precision and passion, the Astral exhaust is engineered to deliver exceptional performance, style, and durability. Built using advanced ceramic wool technology, it ensures optimal exhaust flow and thermal resistance, allowing you to conquer the open road with ease. Unleash the power within your Shotgun 650 as the Red Rooster Astral exhaust enhances the bike’s performance, granting you a seamless blend of torque and horsepower. The captivating thump will resonate through the streets, making a statement that commands attention and admiration. Every curve, every turn, and every moment on your Shotgun 650 will be elevated with the Red Rooster Performance Astral Exhaust. Embrace the essence of cruising in its truest form, and experience the sheer joy of the ride like never before. Upgrade to the Red Rooster Astral Exhaust and witness your Shotgun 650 charisma reach new heights, setting you apart as the king of the road. Unleash the spirit of adventure, embrace the power of the cruiser, and let the world know that you ride with the heart of a true explorer. This is more than just an exhaust; it’s an astral journey into the realm of unforgettable riding experiences.55:T749,Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes Set (Polish) – For Hunter 350 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Hunter 350 with the Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes Set, designed to deliver superior performance, enhanced exhaust flow, and a bold premium look. Crafted with precision and finished in a stunning high-polish shine, these header pipes transform both the style and ride quality of your motorcycle. Key Features: High-Quality Construction: Made from durable, heat-resistant materials for long-lasting performance. Improved Exhaust Flow: Optimized design helps reduce back pressure and supports better engine breathing. Enhanced Performance: Experience smoother throttle response and a noticeable power improvement. Premium Polish Finish: Gives your Hunter 350 a sleek, eye-catching and custom look. Perfect Fit for Hunter 350: Directly compatible with Royal Enfield Hunter 350 for easy installation. Corrosion \\u0026 Heat Resistant: Built to handle tough riding conditions and long journeys. Why Choose Red Rooster? Red Rooster is known for delivering performance-oriented exhaust systems and components designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand quality, style, and reliability. This header pipe set ensures optimal performance without compromising engine safety. Benefits: Better sound output when paired with performance exhausts Enhanced engine efficiency Improved aesthetic appeal Lightweight and durable construction Compatibility: ✔ Royal Enfield Hunter 350 (All Variants) Package Includes: 1 x Pair of Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes (Polished) Installation-ready components Installation: This header pipe set is designed for easy fitment. Professional installation is recommended for best results and optimal performance. Give your Hunter 350 the performance boost and premium style it truly deserves with the Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes Set.56:T60f,Key Features: Deep, Throaty Sound Up to 10% Increase in Engine Performance Lightweight Build Rust-Free Durability Conquer Every Terrain – With the Red Rooster Performance Vertex Pro Exhaust for Royal Enfield Himalayan 450. Purpose-built for the wild, the Vertex Pro is precision-engineered to amplify your Himalayan 450’s true adventure potential. Crafted using premium Grade 304 stainless steel and high-temperature Resisting Imported Stitched Blanket, this exhaust system is designed to endure the harshest conditions while delivering consistent high performance. From steep climbs to open highways, the Vertex Pro optimizes exhaust flow, reduces backpressure, and sheds unnecessary weight – resulting in significantly improved throttle response, torque delivery, and top-end power. Whether you're riding through mountain passes or city streets, every twist of the wrist brings a surge of controlled aggression and unmistakable punch. What sets the Vertex Pro apart isn’t just performance – it's the signature exhaust note. A bold, deep, and commanding thump that complements the Himalayan 450’s rugged dual-sport character, giving your ride a voice that speaks volumes wherever the road takes you. Elevate your Himalayan experience with the Red Rooster Performance Vertex Pro – the perfect fusion of adventure-ready durability, tuned performance, and head-turning sound. Ride farther. Ride stronger. Ride with Red Rooster. Installation: Easy bolt-on installation that fits straight onto your existing setup with no big changes needed.57:T558,Silver Stallion Exhaust For Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT 650 Twin-Black Matte Experience unmatched performance with the Silver Stallion exhaust system, designed specifically for the Royal Enfield Interceptor and GT 650 Twin. This high-performance exhaust delivers a noticeable power and torque boost, while its durable design ensures longevity and optimal performance under all conditions. Performance Boost:- +2 BHP increase in horsepower +4.9 NM torque surge Specifications \\u0026 Features:- First in India with Low Temperature Radiant Technology Highly Water-Resistant – durable in all weather conditions No loss of wool – ensures long-lasting performance No change in sound – retains the authentic Royal Enfield character Switchable Sound Baffle – toggle between loud and quiet modes without compromising performance Distinctive Exhaust Note – tuned for a unique and aggressive tone No Exhaust Drone – smooth and refined auditory experience Design \\u0026 Build:- Easy Installation – precision fit, no modifications needed Weight Reduction – improves handling and performance Exhaust Weight: Only 5.5 kg Material: High-grade SS304 Stainless Steel Perfect Weight Distribution – enhances bike balance and maneuverability Sporty, Aggressive Design – complements the aesthetics of the Interceptor and GT 650 Available in Variations:- Polish Matte Matt Black58:T52a,Silver Stallion Exhaust For Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT 650 Twin-Brushed finishes Experience unmatched performance with the Silver Stallion exhaust system, designed specifically for the Royal Enfield Interceptor and GT 650 Twin. This high-performance exhaust delivers a noticeable power and torque boost, while its durable design ensures longevity and optimal performance under all conditions. Performance Upgrade: +2 BHP power boost +4.9 NM torque surge Key Features: India’s First with Low Temperature Radiant Coating – optimized for heat control Highly Water-Resistant – suitable for all-weather riding No Wool Loss – long-term durability without degradation Consistent Sound Profile – retains the bike's original character Switchable Sound Baffle – choose between loud or quiet modes without affecting performance Distinctive Exhaust Note – sporty, aggressive tone without drone Eliminates Exhaust Drone – for a smoother ride experience Design \\u0026 Build: Easy Bolt-On Installation – custom fit for Interceptor \\u0026 GT 650, no modifications required Material: Lightweight, premium SS304 Stainless Steel Exhaust Weight: Only 5.5 kg Perfect Weight Distribution – enhances handling and control Sporty Aesthetic – complements the Royal Enfield design language Available Finishes: Polish Matte Matt Black59:T1176,AEW Performance Full System Exhaust - Guerrilla 450 This is on made to order and will need 15-20 days to get ready against order. AEW Performance Full System Exhaust - The Guerrilla 450 is a high-performance exhaust system specifically engineered to enhance the Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450. Crafted from premium 304-grade stainless steel with a matt polish finish, this full system exhaust combines superior performance, refined sound, and a sleek, aggressive look, designed to elevate your bike's overall riding experience. Key Features: Medium Tone Thump: The AEW Performance Full System Exhaust delivers a medium-tone thump, providing your Guerrilla 450 with a powerful, deep sound that’s perfect for those who appreciate a bold exhaust note. The thump adds a noticeable presence without overwhelming the riding experience. Enhanced Bottom to Mid-Range Performance: The exhaust is engineered to optimize bottom to mid-range power, enhancing throttle response and offering smoother acceleration. This boost in power ensures a more dynamic and responsive ride, whether you're navigating city streets or cruising on the open road. Free Flow Design: With its free-flow exhaust design, the AEW Performance Full System minimizes exhaust restrictions, allowing gases to flow more freely. This leads to improved engine efficiency, greater power output, and enhanced throttle response. 304-Grade Stainless Steel Construction: Constructed from 304-grade stainless steel, the AEW Performance Full System is built for durability, corrosion resistance, and long-lasting performance. The matt polish finish gives the exhaust a sleek, modern look that complements the Guerrilla 450’s rugged design. Full System Exhaust: Unlike a slip-on system, the AEW Performance Full System replaces the entire exhaust setup, including headers and mid-pipe, providing more significant performance improvements. The full system ensures a smoother exhaust flow and optimized power delivery for a truly upgraded ride. Designed for Guerrilla 450: The AEW EDGE Performance Full System is custom-designed to fit the Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450, ensuring a perfect fit and seamless integration with your bike’s design. Product Specifications: Material: 304-grade stainless steel with a matt polish finish Exhaust Type: Full system (includes headers, mid-pipe, and slip-on) Sound: Medium tone thump Performance: Improved bottom to mid-range power, better throttle response, and smoother acceleration Fitment: Designed specifically for Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 Finish: Matt polish for a sleek, high-quality look Why Choose AEW Performance Full System Exhaust for Guerrilla 450? Maximum Performance: The full system exhaust is designed to optimize exhaust flow, providing greater power and smoother performance, especially in the bottom and mid-range. Bold Sound: Enjoy the bold, refined medium-tone thump that enhances the bike's overall presence and sound. Durable Construction: Made from 304-grade stainless steel, this exhaust system offers exceptional durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it will perform reliably for years to come. Sleek Aesthetic: The matt polish finish adds a stylish and aggressive look to your Guerrilla 450, making it stand out wherever you ride. Perfect Fit: Designed specifically for the Guerrilla 450, this full system exhaust provides an optimal fit with no modifications required. The AEW Performance Full System Exhaust for Guerrilla 450 is the perfect upgrade for riders looking to improve their bike’s performance, sound, and appearance. This full system exhaust is designed for maximum power with a free-flow design, providing a bold medium-tone thump and enhanced throttle response. Made from durable 304-grade stainless steel with a matt polish finish, it’s built to last and perfectly complements the design of your Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450. Whether you're after more power or a striking new sound, the AEW Performance Full System Exhaust is the ideal choice. Note: AEW Product Availability \\u0026 Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-9300720789\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"5a:T1402,AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Mirror Polish - Interceptor /GT 650 AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Mirror Polish is an upgraded exhaust silencer designed specifically for the Interceptor GT 650 and GT 650 models. This high-quality exhaust provides not only a boost in performance but also a sleek, shiny aesthetic that enhances the bike's look. Below are the key details of this product: Key Features: Slightly Fatter Construction: The TE 102 Megaphone is similar to the TE 101, but it features a slightly fatter construction, adding more presence to your bike. This gives it a more substantial and bold look. High-Quality Stainless Steel Mirror Polish: Fabricated from high-quality stainless steel, the TE 102 is finished with a mirror polish, giving it a bright, reflective surface that stands out and elevates your bike’s aesthetic appeal. Heat Shield for Enhanced Look: The TE 102 comes equipped with a heat shield that conceals the silencer mounts, improving the visual appeal by providing a cleaner, more finished appearance. Lightweight Sound Damping Insulation: The exhaust is fitted with lightweight sound-damping insulation, which helps reduce vibrations and enhances the overall sound quality, making it more refined and pleasant. Weight Reduction: The TE 102 reduces the bike's weight by 4.5 kg, contributing to a lighter and more agile bike that responds more quickly to throttle inputs and is easier to handle. Improved Bottom and Mid-Range Torque: This exhaust is designed to improve bottom and mid-range torque, offering better throttle response and smoother acceleration, particularly in lower to mid-rev ranges. Signature Rumble Sound: The TE 102 Megaphone is known for its signature rumble sound. The exhaust produces a deep, throaty tone that is especially noticeable when downshifting through gears or braking, adding to the overall riding experience. Removable DB Killer: The exhaust comes with an easily removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer, giving you the flexibility to adjust the exhaust’s sound output to your preference. You can have a quieter ride or let the bike roar, depending on your mood. Direct Fit, Slip-On Installation: The TE 102 is a direct fit and features a slip-on mounting system, making it incredibly easy to install without the need for modifications or special tools. This means a quick upgrade for your bike with minimal hassle. Product Specifications: Material: High-quality stainless steel with mirror polish finish Weight Reduction: Reduces the bike’s weight by 4.5 kg Sound: Delivers a deep, signature rumble sound, especially noticeable during downshifting and braking Torque: Increases bottom and mid-range torque, improving throttle response and acceleration DB Killer: Includes an easily removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer Heat Shield: Comes with a heat shield for enhanced styling and concealed silencer mounts Design: Retro-inspired styling with a mirror polish finish Dimensions: 56 × 23 × 13 cm Weight: 6.5 kg Why Choose the AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Mirror Polish for Interceptor GT 650 / GT 650? Performance: The AEW TE 102 Megaphone enhances bottom and mid-range torque, providing more responsive acceleration and smoother throttle control, which improves overall performance. Sound: With its signature rumble, the exhaust delivers a distinctive, aggressive sound, especially when downshifting or braking, making your ride more enjoyable and unique. Aesthetic Appeal: The mirror-polished stainless steel gives your bike a high-end, reflective finish, elevating its appearance. The heat shield ensures that the silencer mounts are hidden, adding to the exhaust’s sleek look. Weight Reduction: By shedding 4.5 kg, this exhaust makes your bike lighter, improving handling and performance. Easy Installation: The slip-on mounting system ensures that the exhaust is easy to install without the need for complicated modifications, offering a hassle-free upgrade. Flexibility: The removable DB killer gives you the option to adjust the exhaust's sound, allowing you to tailor the bike's noise level to your personal preference. The AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Mirror Polish is a perfect upgrade for your Interceptor GT 650 or GT 650. It offers improved performance, enhanced sound, and a shiny, sleek aesthetic that complements the bike’s design. With its signature rumble, weight reduction, 