file for enhanced styling Signature rumble sound on downshifting and braking Removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer Retro-inspired design Also available in chrome-plated or stainless steel finishes Weight: 5.5 kg Dimensions: 57 × 26 × 13 cm The AEW TE 101 Megaphone Exhaust in full black provides the perfect balance of style, performance, and sound, making it an excellent choice for Royal Enfield Interceptor or GT 650 riders who want to enhance their riding experience with a touch of retro flair. Note: AEW Product Availability \\u0026 Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 15-20 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once an order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-930072078966:Tc85,AEW EDGE Free Flow Exhaust For Bear 650 AEW EDGE Free Flow Exhaust for Bear 650 is a high-performance upgrade designed to elevate the riding experience with a perfect blend of enhanced power, sound, and style. Crafted from premium Stainless Steel 304, this exhaust promises exceptional durability, resistance to corrosion, and a sleek, eye-catching finish that will make your Bear 650 stand out on the road. Key Features: Enhanced Power: The AEW Edge Exhaust is specifically engineered to optimize the bottom-end and mid-range power of your Bear 650, improving throttle responsiveness and delivering better overall performance for a smoother, more dynamic ride. Rich, Bassy Sound: Enjoy a deep, throaty exhaust note that adds a bold, rich tone to your bike. The AEW Edge exhaust delivers an attention-grabbing sound that enhances your riding experience without being overwhelming. Customizable Mid Pipe Options: Free Flow Mid Pipe: Ideal for riders seeking maximum performance, the free-flow mid-pipe option ensures minimal exhaust restriction, allowing for enhanced power output and a more aggressive exhaust note. Mid Pipe with Performance Cat: This option eliminates the primary muffler, offering a balance of improved performance and eco-friendliness by maintaining better emissions control. Why Choose AEW Edge Exhaust? Durability: Constructed from Stainless Steel 304, the AEW Edge Exhaust is built to withstand harsh conditions and provide lasting performance without corroding over time. The high-quality finish ensures it will look good for years to come. Performance Boost: With optimized power delivery in the bottom and mid-range, the AEW Edge Exhaust provides improved acceleration, better throttle response, and a smoother, more enjoyable riding experience. Sound: The exhaust produces a bold, bassy tone that commands attention and enhances the overall riding experience, making it perfect for riders who want a distinctive sound that’s both aggressive and refined. Product Specifications: Weight: 2.5 kg Dimensions: 12 × 12 × 52 cm Material: Premium Stainless Steel 304 Finish: High-quality, corrosion-resistant Sound: Deep, throaty, rich bass tone Performance: Optimized for bottom and mid-range power The AEW EDGE Free Flow Exhaust for the Bear 650 is the ultimate upgrade for riders looking to boost their bike’s performance, sound, and aesthetics. With enhanced power delivery, a rich exhaust tone, and durable construction, the AEW Edge Exhaust ensures you get the most out of your Bear 650. Whether you choose the Free Flow Mid Pipe for maximum performance or the Mid Pipe with Performance Cat for a balance of power and emissions control, this exhaust system will take your ride to the next level. Note: AEW Product Availability \\u0026 Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it ca