ht. Get ready to feel the power like never before! With our Stellar exhaust, brace yourself for a surge in torque, an electrifying throttle response, and an impressive boost in horsepower across the entire rev range. Each twist of the throttle will be met with unmatched precision and exhilaration. But that’s not all – the Red Rooster Performance Exhaust doesn’t just enhance performance. It also adds a captivating and aggressive sporty thump, showcasing the true character of the Continental GT/ Interceptor 650’s parallel-twin engine. It’s more than just an upgrade; it’s an expression of pure adrenaline! Step up your riding game with the Red Rooster Performance Stellar Exhaust – where power, style, and the heart-pounding beat of the road converge into one thrilling symphony! Experience power at play with Red Rooster! Additional Information:- Weight (Kg) Length (cm) Breadth (cm) Height (cm) 8 64 39 186b:Ta5e,Red-Rooster Performance Stellar-X Exhaust-(Polish) For Bear-650 Command attention and conquer the road with the Stellar-X Exhaust by Red Rooster Performance — designed exclusively for the Bear 650. Crafted from aerospace-grade stainless steel and built for maximum performance and durability, the Stellar-X delivers a distinctive deep thump, enhanced throttle response, and up to 10% gains in power and torque. With bold styling, precision engineering, and effortless installation, this is more than just an exhaust — it’s your bike’s voice. Key Features:- Performance \\u0026 Power:- Up to 10% Performance Gain in horsepower and torque Free-flow baffle system with optimized mandrel bends for superior exhaust flow No ECU remap required – plug-and-play setup Build Quality \\u0026 Materials:- Made from aerospace-grade SS 304 stainless steel Polished finish for a sleek, premium look Imported 3B glass wool insulation ensures top-tier thermal control Next-Gen Thermal Shielding:- Built-in stitched blanket insulation reduces heat buildup Enhances riding comfort and reduces strain