026 Durability: SS304 Stainless Steel: long-lasting, rust-proof, and heat-resistant construction for superior durability. Weight: Lightweight at 3.06 Kg, maintaining a balanced and nimble ride. 4. Innovative Heat \\u0026 Sound Management: Glass Wool Insulation: Made with premium 3B-imported glass wool insulation to manage heat effectively and provide a quieter ride. Optimal Thermal Efficiency ensures heat is properly managed, providing a safer and more comfortable riding experience. 5. Easy Installation \\u0026 Long-Term Reliability: Plug \\u0026 Play Installation: The Atlas Pro Exhaust is designed for easy, no-hassle installation Lifetime Warranty on Body: Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body, ensuring durability and peace of mind. Specifications:- Feature Details Exhaust Type Slip-on Design Rear Vented Finish Sound Deeper, Louder, Sportier with a Growl Weight 3.06 Kg Material SS304 Stainless Steel Plug \\u0026 Play Install Yes Warranty (Body) Lifetime Red Rooster Performance Atlas Pro-Exhaust benefits:- Tailored for Performance and Aesthetics: Designed for the Royal Enfield Classic 650, this exhaust offers the perfect balance of performance and retro styling. Aggressive Sound \\u0026 Design: With its deeper, sportier growl and vented rear finish, it stands out from the crowd, making your ride both thrilling and stylish. Comfort \\u0026 Performance Without Compromise Featuring a pillion-friendly design, this exhaust ensures no heat issues and enhances comfort on long rides. Red Rooster Engineering Legacy Backed by years of performance engineering, this exhaust is built to last, providing both long-term durability and premium performance . Why Upgrade to Atlas Pro-Exhaust? Bold Performance: Achieve up to 10% performance gain when enhancing throttle response and overall bike power. Timeless Yet Bold Design: The vented rear holes provide a modern, aggressive look while still paying homage to the vintage aesthetic of the Classic 650. Enhanced Ride Comfort: Pillion-friendly, with no heat issues and a focus on rider comfort without sacrificing performance or sound quality. Important Notes:- Warrant: Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body. 36-month warranty on insulation material (T\\u0026C Apply). Installation: Plug-and-play installation makes it quick and easy to add the Atlas Pro exhaust to your bike. Upgrade Your Ride Today! Choose the Red Rooster Performance Atlas Pro-Exhaust for your Royal Enfield Classic 650 and experience a new level of performance, sound, and styl. Perfect for riders who want to stand out and ride with power and class.72:Te1f,Red Rooster Performance Atlas Pro-Exhaust (Matte) For Royal Enfield Classic 650 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Classic 650 with the Red Rooster Performance Atlas Pro-Exhaust – designed for those who demand boldness, performance, and style. Featuring an aggressive design with rear vented holes, the Atlas Pro combines sporty aesthetics with enhanced performance, making it the perfect exhaust system for enthusiasts seeking both power and personality. Key Features:- 1. Aggressive Design with Modern Retro Aesthetics: Vented Rear Holes add a sporty edge to the design while retaining the classic vintage feel. Modern Retro Look: Tailored for riders who want boldness and performance without compromising on style. 2. Performance \\u0026 Comfort: Performance Gain: Achieve up to 10% performance improvement, enhancing both power and throttle response. Pillion-Friendly Design Comfortable for both rider and pillion, ensuring no heat issues during rides. Enhanced Exhaust Sound: Produces a deeper, louder, and sportier sound with a signature growl, without harshness. 3. Premium Build \\u0026 Durability: SS304 Stainless Steel: long-lasting, rust-proof, and heat-resistant construction for superior durability. Weight: Lightweight at 3.06 Kg, maintaining a balanced and nimble ride. 4. Innovative Heat \\u0026 Sound Management: Glass Wool Insulation: Made with premium 3B-imported glass wool insulation to manage h