power by up to 20%. Iconic Sound: Amplifies the signature Royal Enfield exhaust note for a deeper, more satisfying thump. Premium Build Quality: Made from SS304 grade stainless steel for rust-free, long-lasting durability. Ceramic Wool Insulation: Superior thermal resistance compared to traditional glass wool for better heat control. Chrome Finish: High-gloss polish adds a striking, classic look to your bike. Lifetime Material Warranty: Backed by a warranty for material integrity and peace of mind. What’s Included: 1 Exhaust Silencer Mounting Clamps Keychain Sticker User Manual Compatibility: Royal Enfield Classic 350/500 (Pre-2021) Royal Enfield Bullet 350/500 (Pre-2023) Royal Enfield Thunderbird 350/500 Dimensions: Weight: 5 kg Length: 87 cm Breadth: 17 cm Height: 16 cm Why Choose Red Rooster Rumbler – Polish Edition? Whether you're after better throttle response, enhanced visual appeal, or the timeless Royal Enfield exhaust note, the Red Rooster Rumbler in Chrome delivers it all. Ideal for riders who want reliable performance with head-turning style.83:T588,Red Rooster Rumbler–Matte Exhaust for Royal Enfield Standard 500 Upgrade your Royal Enfield with the Red Rooster Performance Rumbler Exhaust in a premium Brushed Steel (Matte) finish. Engineered for power and durability, this exhaust delivers up to 20% boost in performance, while enhancing the signature Royal Enfield thump. Key Features: Improved Performance: Optimized exhaust flow boosts engine output by up to 20%. Authentic Sound: Deep, powerful Royal Enfield thump for a more engaging ride. Durable Build: Made from high-grade SS304 stainless steel for rust-free, long-lasting performance. Ceramic Wool Insulation: Superior to traditional glass wool, offering better heat resistance and longevity. Matte Finish: Brushed steel design adds a rugged, premium look to your bike. Lifetime Material Warranty: Ride worry-free with guaranteed material quality. What’s Included: 1 Exhaust Silencer Mounting Clamps Keychain St