e the original lambda sensor. The removal of the original catalytic converter allows an important reduction of the operating temperature as well as giving a deep and gloomy sound to your Z900, the true distinctive mark of the SC-Project range. Available in full titanium or stainless steel AISI 304 CNC machined from solid billet titanium for perfect fitting Best performance improvement both in power and in torque OEM decat headers Stock O2 sensor housing 4-2-1 Design Features PART NUMBER K25-SS-FS Exhaust Type Headers Only Header Material Stainless Steel, Titanium Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Z900 / 2019, Kawasaki / Z900 / 2018, Kawasaki / Z900 / 2017 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts \\u0026 Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.b7:T7fa,SC PROJECT S1 Exhaust For Triumph Street Triple 765 Triumph Street Triple 765 PART NUMBER: T18-LTS41T Product Description The S1 muffler, a benchmark for the Superbike World Championship, is available with a titanium tapered body and matt carbon fibre end cap and, depending on the model of motorcycle, with the spectacular titanium flame arrester on the output. The S1 muffler fuses a racing style with valued technical solutions such as bracket and fitting welding with T.I.G. technology or titanium insert bushings machined from solid by CNC machines, which guarantee impeccable couplings. The S1's tapered body, together with the diameter of the output and the particular internal soundproofing, gives the bike on which it is fitted a dark and unmistakable sound. Aeronautical grade materials Large diameter exhaust outlet Bike specific exhaust mounting hardware included 24 month factory defect warranty Race Replica Noise data: 103 dB @ 5850 rpm (with dB-Killer on) 109 dB @ 5850 rpm (without dB-Killer) Features PART NUMBER T18-LTS41T Exhaust Finish Titanium, Matte Black Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Slip-on Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium dB Killer Yes Make/Model/Year Triumph / Street Triple R 765 / 2020, Triumph / Street Triple R 765 / 2021, Triumph / Street Triple R 765 / 2022, Triumph / Street Triple RS 765 / 2020, Triumph / Street Triple RS 765 / 2021, Triumph / Street Triple RS 765 / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts \\u0026 Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.b8:T5b9,SC PROJECT S1 Exhaust For Kawasaki Zx10R Kawasaki Zx10R (2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET41T Product Description SC-Project is a race tested and race proven Italian exhaust manufacturer. SC-Project uses their MotoGP, Moto3, Moto2 and Superbike racing experience to push the limits and develop the highest level of exhaust performance. The SC-Project S1 exhaust is a tapered exhaust with a large outlet diameter for enhanced exhaust air flow. The S1 performance is based off of technology directly developed in World Superbike racing. The silencer body features a conical shape for proper back pressure and optimal ground clearance during extreme lean angles. Features Line S