ng hardware included 24 month factory defect warranty Optimized exhaust shape for high lean angles Titanium Decat Link Pipe Weight : - 5 Kg (Stock 7,5 Kg / SC 2,5 Kg) Noise level : 106 dB at 7000 rpm (WITH DB-KILLER) 113 dB at 7000 rpm (WITHOUT DB-KILLER) Features PART NUMBER K38-DET91T Exhaust Version Race Version Exhaust Finish Matte Carbon Fiber, Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Half System Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium Titanium Mesh on Exhaust Outlet Yes dB Killer Yes Sound dB Rating 106 dB @ 7000 rpm (with dB-Killer) Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2022, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts \\u0026 Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"ba:T859,SC PROJECT SC1 R Carbon Exhaust For Kawasaki Zx10R Kawasaki Zx10R (2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET91C Product Description The muffler SC1-R is created and developed by the experience of the SC-Project racing department in the most important World Competitions. A look with taut and decided lines will enrich Your Kawasaki Ninja ZX-10R making it unique and exclusive. The exit pipe obtained by hydroforming and the carbon fiber end cap from the rhomboidal asymmetric shape make inimitable the silencer SC1-R. The lightweight outer body is available in Carbon version. The weldings with T.I.G., the sound-absorbing material resistant to very high temperatures and the insert bushings made in CNC machining embellish the SC1-R silencer. In the version Carbon on the silencer is applied an insert with the SC-Project logo as in the versions of our mufflers used in Competitions. In the kit are included the full titanium link pipe and the carbon heat protection. Weight : 5 Kg (Stock 7,5 Kg / SC 2,5 Kg) Noise level : L106 dB at 7000 rpm (WITH DB-KILLER) 113 dB at 7000 rpm (WITHOUT DB-KILLER) Features PART NUMBER K38-DET91C Exhaust Version Race Version Exhaust Finish Matte Carbon Fiber, Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Half System Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium Titanium Mesh on Exhaust Outlet Yes dB Killer Yes Sound dB Rating 106 dB @ 7000 rpm (with dB-Killer) Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2022, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts \\u0026 Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.bb:T85b,SC PROJECT CR-T CARBON EXHAUST FOR KAWASAKI ZX10R KAWASAKI ZX10R2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET36C Product Description SC-Project is a race tested and race proven Italian exhaust manufacturer. SC-Project uses their MotoGP, Moto3, Moto2 and Superbike racing experience to push the limits and develop the highest level of exhaust performance The CR-T, a multiple World-Champion muffler, is the most widely recognized design of the SC-Project exhaust range. This iconic muffler offers perfo