ith optional headers, we recommend to use the noise insert that comes with the slip-on system in order to achieve the best possible performance. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 32.6 / 10300 33.9 / 10300 + 1.8 / 11000 HP (m) 44.3 / 10300 46.1 / 10300 + 2.4 / 11000 HP (i) 43.7 / 10300 45.4 / 10300 + 2.4 / 11000 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 35.8 / 8100 36.1 / 8200 +1.1 / 3300 Ib-ft 26.4 / 8100 26.6 / 8200 + 0.8 / 3300 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 4.08 1.69- 2.4 - 2.4 Ib 9 3.7- 5.3 - 5.3 % - 58.6 Volume UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Volume dB 86.6 / 5000 94 / 5000 7.4 Inst. time: Min 20 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c1:T763,AKRAPOVIC KAWASAKI NINJA ZX 10R (2021-2022) Slip-On Line (Carbon)PART NUMBER: S-K10SO27-HRC Power +0.4 kW at 11300 rpm Torque +0.6 Nm at 11300 rpm Weight -0.7 kg This race-inspired hexagonal muffler is made from beautifully crafted carbon fibre while the updated end cap is now made out of light-weight titanium. The EC-ECE type-approved exhaust delivers an increase in both power and torque across the rev range. The use of titanium for the pipes and muffler inner parts creates an additional reduction in weight. An optional link-pipe is available to improve performance and an optional carbon-fibre muffler bracket to enhance the appearance. When used with the link pipe, the ECU must be remapped. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 137.8 / 13450 138.1 / 13500 + 0.4 / 11300 HP (m) 187.3 / 13450 187.7 / 13500 + 0.5 / 11300 HP (i) 184.8 / 13450 185.2 / 13500 + 0.5 / 11300 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 107.1 / 11700 107.3 / 11800 + 0.6 / 11300 Ib-ft 79 / 11700 79.1 / 11800 + 0.4 / 11300 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.07 2.39- 0.7 - 0.7 Ib 6.8 5.3- 1.5 - 1.5 % - 22.1 UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Inst. time Min 30 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View AUS Approval: View ECE Type Certificate: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c2:T944,AKRAPOVIC Kawasaki Z900 (2025) Slip On (Titanium) (S-K9SO12-ASZT) Slip-On (Titanium)PART NUMBER: S-K9SO12-ASZT Power:+0.8 kW at 9000 rpm Torque: +0.9 Nm at 6800 rpm Weight: -2.4 kg Designed for markets where EC/ECE type approvals are not required, or for track-day use, this titanium exhaust offers a weight savings over the stock system allied to a performance increase for the Z900. It is finished with a carbon-fibre endcap to improve looks and features a new conical muffler design that fits perfectly within the lines of the bike. The Slip-On Line (Titanium) delivers a louder, deeper, and even crisper sound. Simple plug-and-play installation, with no remapping needed, makes this an easy performance upgrade for the Z900.The product is developed and tested on EU vehicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. This exhaust system fits also on Z900 2025 A2 model. The displayed photographs show the slip-on in combination with our optional headers. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 82.3 / 9700 rpm 83.7 / 9650 rpm + 0.8 / 9000 rpm HP (m) 111.9 / 9700 rpm 113.8 / 9650 rpm + 1.1 / 9000 rpm HP (i) 110.3 / 9700 rpm 112.2 / 9650 rpm + 1.1 / 9000 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 92 / 8100 rpm 93.6 / 8100 rpm + 0.9 / 6800 rpm Ib-ft 67.9 / 8100 rpm 69 / 8100 rpm + 0.7 / 6800 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.93 1.5 - 2.4 Ib 8.7 3.3 - 5.4 % - 61.8 Volume: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM dB 97 / 4750 rpm 101 / 4750 rpm 4 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 30 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"c3:T8b9,AKRAPOVIC Kawasaki Z900 (2025) Slip On (Carbon Fibre) (S-K9SO11-HZC) Slip-On (Carbon Fibre)PART NUMBER: S-K9SO11-HZC Power: +1.7 kW at 9500 rpm Torque: +1.8 Nm at 9500 rpm Weight: -2.1 kg This beautifully designed exhaust has a more compact shape to fit with the bike’s naked and sporty appearance. It is constructed using hand-crafted carbon fibre parts and finished with an end-cap in the same perfectly finished race-proven material. Power and torque increases throughout the range and a weight savings over the stock system all add to improved performance. It serves up an enriched tone for added aural enjoyment and is EC/ECE type approved. Easy-to-follow plug-and-play instructions with no remapping makes this a simple upgrade to improve the Z900. The product is developed and tested on EU vehicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 87.2 / 9500 rpm 88.8 / 9500 rpm + 1.7 / 9500 rpm HP (m) 118.6 / 9500 rpm 120.8 / 9500 rpm + 2.3 / 9500 rpm HP (i) 116.9 / 9500 rpm 119.1 / 9500 rpm + 2.3 / 9500 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 95.3 / 8000 rpm 96.4 / 8000 rpm + 1.8 / 9500 rpm Ib-ft 70.3 / 8000 rpm 71.1 / 8000 rpm + 1.3 / 9500 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 4.12 2.04 - 2.1 Ib 9.1 4.5 - 4.6 % - 50.5 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 30 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View ECE Type-Approval Certificate: View ECE Type-Approval Certificate: View AUS Approval: View AUS Approval: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c4:T8da,AKRAPOVIC Kawasaki Z900 (2025) Header (SS) (E-K9R7) Header (Stainless Steel)PART NUMBER: E-K9R7 Power: +5.1 kW at 9850 rpm Torque: +4.7 Nm at 7000 rpm Weight: -4.4 kg The performance of the Slip-On Line exhausts can be further enhanced with the addition of the optional stainless-steel header. When this beautifully finished header is added to any Slip-On Line exhaust for the Z900, it turns the muffler into a complete racing system and increases power to even greater levels of enjoyment. The addition of the header will also improve the sound of the exhaust, giving it a crisper racing tone. The product is developed and tested on EU vehicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. This product fits also on Z900 2025 A2 model. When installing the Racing Line exhaust system on Euro5+ motorbikes (2 lambda sensors), the engine check light will appear after identifying a deviation in the stock catalytic converter´s parameters. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 82.3 / 9700 rpm 87.4 / 9750 rpm + 5.1 / 9850 rpm HP (m) 111.9 / 9700 rpm 118.8 / 9750 rpm + 7 / 9850 rpm HP (i) 110.3 / 9700 rpm 117.1 / 9750 rpm + 6.9 / 9850 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 92 / 8100 rpm 96 / 8750 rpm + 4.7 / 7000 rpm Ib-ft 67.9 / 8100 rpm 70.8 / 8750 rpm + 3.5 / 7000 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 7.77 3.4 - 4.4 Ib 17.1 7.5 - 9.6 % - 56.2 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 120 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c5:T995,AKRAPOVIC Kawasaki ZX6R (2013-2023) Optional Link Pipe (SS) (L-K6SO8/2) Optional Link Pipe (Stainless Steel)PART NUMBER: L-K6SO8/2 Power: +3.4 kW at 6000 rpm Torque: +5.3 Nm at 6000 rpm Weight: -2.2 kg This high-grade stainless-steel link pipe has been developed to optimize gas flow through the removal of the standard stock pre-muffler to enhance performance. A second lambda plug is incorporated into the link pipe. It reduces weight over the standard stock pipe by 79.2% (4.6 kg). It offers impressive power and torque gains in the mid and high rpm range, with increases of 2.4 kW (3.3 hp) at 6,250 rpm and 3.2 Nm at 6,250 rpm, respectively, when fitted to the Slip-On Line (Carbon) and compared to a Kawasaki Ninja ZX-6R equipped with a standard stock system and tested on the Akrapovič dyno. It delivers a deep racing sound and is a plug-and-play installation with no remapping needed. FITMENT NOTICE: This product has been developed and tested for EU vehicle specifications. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specifications. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 86.5 / 13300 rpm 88.8 / 13100 rpm + 3.4 / 6000 rpm HP (m) 117.7 / 13300 rpm 120.7 / 13100 rpm + 4.6 / 6000 rpm HP (i) 116.1 / 13300 rpm 119 / 13100 rpm + 4.5 / 6000 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 67.7 / 11000 rpm 68.3 / 11000 rpm + 5.3 / 6000 rpm Ib-ft 49.9 / 11000 rpm 50.4 / 11000 rpm + 3.9 / 6000 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 2.75 0.53 - 2.2 Ib 6.1 1.2 - 4.9 % - 80.7 Volume UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM dB / rpm 104.1 / 6750 rpm Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINR