r mounting Welded mount Silencer body lenght (mm) 0,00 Junction (inlet) diameter (mm) 0,00 Junction (outlet) diameter (mm) 0,00 CO sensor plug No Oxygen sensor plug Si Db Killer No Documents: Middle Joint: View IMPORTANT NOTE: ARROW PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. ARROW products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.ce:T825,AKRAPOVIC KAWASAKI Z900 2020Slip-On Line (Titanium)PART NUMBER: S-K9SO7-ASZT Power +0.8 kW at 9000 rpm Torque +0.9 Nm at 6800 rpm Weight -2.4 kg Designed for markets where EC/ECE type approvals are not required, or for track-day use, this titanium exhaust offers a weight savings over the stock system allied to a performance increase for the Z900. It is finished with a carbon-fibre end cap to improve looks and features a new conical muffler design that fits perfectly within the lines of the bike. The Slip-On Line (Titanium) delivers a louder, deeper, and even crisper sound. Simple plug-and-play installation, with no remapping needed, makes this an easy performance upgrade for the Z900. The product is developed and tested on EU vehicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 82.3 / 9700 83.7 / 9650 + 0.8 / 9000 HP (m) 111.9 / 9700 113.8 / 9650 + 1.1 / 9000 HP (i) 110.3 / 9700 112.2 / 9650 + 1.1 / 9000 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 92.0 / 8100 93.6 / 8100 + 0.9 / 6800 Ib-ft 67.9 / 8100 69.0 / 8100 + 0.7 / 6800 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.9 1.5 - 2.4 Ib 8.7 3.3 - 5.4 % - 61.8 UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Noise DB 97 / 4750 101 / 4750 4 Inst. time Min 30 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.cf:T582,Two Brothers Racing Harley Davidson Sportster (2004-2013)Comp-S 2-1 Stainless Steel Full System PART NUMBER: 005-4110199 Description: Like all of our products, our Sportster exhaust systems were developed to surpass what is offered on the market today. Engineered to compliment the quality and performance of Harley Davidson’s products, these handcrafted systems deliver unparalleled sound and performance for the ultimate race experience. Features: Dyno tuned for maximum performance. Swept-up muffler for enhanced ground clearance. Carbon fibre end cap. Mandrel bent stainless steel tubing. All TIG welds done by hand. Fits with forward and mid controls. Available in brush finish or ceramic black. Accepts stock O2 sensor. Simple, clean, and functional heat shields included. Drops weight. Instructions: HD Sportster Full System(2004-2013): View IMPORTANT NOTE: TWO BROTHERS RACING PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. TWO BROTHERS RACING products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.d0:T40a,ARROW KAWASAKI Z 900 2020 Pro-Race Nichrom ExhaustPART NUMBER: 71912PRI Pro-Race Nichrom Exhaust: Features Values Silencer material stainless steel Rear endcap material stainless steel Silencer inner parts material stainless steel Mid-pipe material stainless steel Silencer mounting welded mount Silencer body lenght (mm) 250,00 Junction (inlet) diameter (mm) 62,00 Junction (outlet) diameter (mm) 68,00 Oxygen sensor plug NO CO sensor plug NO Db Killer SI Weight (Kg) 1,57 Documents: SPARE PARTS: View IMPORTANT NOTE: ARROW PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. ARROW products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.d1:T6a5,SC PROJECT Cr T Exhaust For Kawasaki Z900 Kawasaki Z900 2020-2023 PART NUMBER: K34-T36CRE Product Description SC-Project is a race tested and race proven Italian exhaust manufacturer. SC-Project uses their MotoGP, Moto3, Moto2 and Superbike racing experience to push the limits and develop the highest level of exhaust performance. The SC-Project S1 exhaust is a tapered exhaust with a large outlet diameter for enhanced exhaust air flow. The S1 performance is based off of technology directly developed in World Superbike racing. The silencer body features a conical shape for proper back pressure and optimal ground clearance during extreme lean angles. Weight:-2,85 Kg (Stock 4,1 Kg / SC 1,25 Kg) Power:+3,5 hp @8250 rpm Torque:+2,8 Nm @8250 rpm Features PART NUMBER K34-T36TR Exhaust Version EURO 4 - Street Legal Exhaust Finish Titanium, Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust End Cap Titanium Exhaust Type Slip-on Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium Titanium Mesh on Exhaust Outlet Yes dB Killer Yes Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Z900 / 2020Kawasaki / Z900 / 2021Kawasaki / Z900 / 2022Kawasaki / Z900 / 2023 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts \\u0026 Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.d2:T805,AKRAPOVIC KAWASAKI Z900 2021Optional Header (SS)PART NUMBER: E-K9R4 Power +5.1 kW at 9850 rpm Torque +4.7 Nm at 7000 rpm Weight -4.4 kg The performance of the Slip-On Line exhausts can be further enhanced with the addition of the optional stainless-steel header. When this beautifully finished header is added to any Slip-On Line exhaust for the Z900, it turns the muffler into a complete racing system and increases power to even greater levels of enjoyment. The addition of the header will also improve the sound of the exhaust, giving it a crisper racing tone. The product is developed and tested on EU vehicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 82.3 / 9700 87.4 / 9750 + 5.1 / 9850 HP (m) 111.9 / 9700 118.8 / 9750 + 7.0 / 9850 HP (i) 110.3 / 9700 117.1 / 9750 + 6.9 / 9850 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 92.0 / 8100 96.0 / 8750 + 4.7 / 7000 Ib-ft 67.9 / 8100 70.8 / 8750 + 3.5 / 7000 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 7.8 3.4 - 4.4 Ib 17.1 7.5 - 9.6 % - 56.2 UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Inst. time Min 120 Ecu remapping:Recommended: For perfect performance, throttle response and durability, special developed mapping is recommended. Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.24:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Exhausts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/exhausts\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",null,{\\\"handle\\\":\\\"exhausts\\\",\\\"initialCollection\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262083389\\\",\\\"handle\\\":\\\"exhausts\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Exhausts\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"ht