oduct Description The Akrapovič Racing system is designed for riders who demand maximum performance. The racing system is lighter if compared to the stock exhaust system and features exceptional production quality, hi-tech materials, and of course, increased engine performance combined with pure racing sound output. The double-flow muffler is a unique combination of a hexagonal shape and a more classic rear endcap, finished with a durable titanium muffler sleeve and robust carbon-fiber clamp. No fuel remapping is required, but for optimal performance use a fuel controller. A combination of beautiful machines and hand welds. Patented hexagonal muffler. Integrated titanium exhaust hanger. CNC machined muffler inlet cap. Optimized to maximize lean angle. All carbon fiber parts are produced in-house. Air-tight quality controlled production means your exhaust will be perfect.\\\",\\\"priceRange\\\":{\\\"minVariantPrice\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"128000.0\\\",\\\"currencyCode\\\":\\\"INR\\\"}},\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/Akrapovic-HONDA-Africa-Twin-Adventure-Sports-Racing-Line-Titanium-2020-Exhaust-Riders-Junction.png?v=1787335740\\\",\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Akrapovic HONDA Africa Twin Adventure Sports Racing Line Titanium 2020+ Exhaust\\\"}],\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52911733670205\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Default Title\\\",\\\"price\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"128000.0\\\",\\\"currencyCode\\\":\\\"INR\\\"},\\\"compareAtPrice\\\":null,\\\"availableForSale\\\":true,\\\"quantityAvailable\\\":null}],\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Akrapovic\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Accessories\\\",\\\"compatibility\\\":[\\\"Akrapovic Accessories\\\"],\\\"specifications\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Akrapovic\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Category\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Accessories\\\"}],\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rev-default-1\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Verified Rider\\\",\\\"rating\\\":5,\\\"date\\\":\\\"20