hicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. This product fits also on Z900 2025 A2 model. When installing the Racing Line exhaust system on Euro5+ motorbikes (2 lambda sensors), the engine check light will appear after identifying a deviation in the stock catalytic converter´s parameters. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 82.3 / 9700 rpm 87.4 / 9750 rpm + 5.1 / 9850 rpm HP (m) 111.9 / 9700 rpm 118.8 / 9750 rpm + 7 / 9850 rpm HP (i) 110.3 / 9700 rpm 117.1 / 9750 rpm + 6.9 / 9850 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 92 / 8100 rpm 96 / 8750 rpm + 4.7 / 7000 rpm Ib-ft 67.9 / 8100 rpm 70.8 / 8750 rpm + 3.5 / 7000 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 7.77 3.4 - 4.4 Ib 17.1 7.5 - 9.6 % - 56.2 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 120 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c5:T995,AKRAPOVIC Kawasaki ZX6R (2013-2023) Optional Link Pipe (SS) (L-K6SO8/2) Optional Link Pipe (Stainless Steel)PART NUMBER: L-K6SO8/2 Power: +3.4 kW at 6000 rpm Torque: +5.3 Nm at 6000 rpm Weight: -2.2 kg This high-grade stainless-steel link pipe has been developed to optimize gas flow through the removal of the standard stock pre-muffler to enhance performance. A second lambda plug is incorporated into the link pipe. It reduces weight over the standard stock pipe by 79.2% (4.6 kg). It offers impressive power and torque gains in the mid and high rpm range, with increases of 2.4 kW (3.3 hp) at 6,250 rpm and 3.2 Nm at 6,250 rpm, respectively, when fitted to the Slip-On Line (Carbon) and compared to a Kawasaki Ninja ZX-6R equipped with a standard stock system and tested on the Akrapovič dyno. It delivers a deep racing sound and is a plug-and-play installation with no remapping needed. FITMENT NOTICE: This product has been developed and tested for EU vehicle specifications. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specifications. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 86.5 / 13300 rpm 88.8 / 13100 rpm + 3.4 / 6000 rpm HP (m) 117.7 / 13300 rpm 120.7 / 13100 rpm + 4.6 / 6000 rpm HP (i) 116.1 / 13300 rpm 119 / 13100 rpm + 4.5 / 6000 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 67.7 / 11000 rpm 68.3 / 11000 rpm + 5.3 / 6000 rpm Ib-ft 49.9 / 11000 rpm 50.4 / 11000 rpm + 3.9 / 6000 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 2.75 0.53 - 2.2 Ib 6.1 1.2 - 4.9 % - 80.7 Volume UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM dB / rpm 104.1 / 6750 rpm Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 20 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Performance graph: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c6:Ta1d,AKRAPOVIC Triumph Scrambler 400X Slip On (Titanium) (S-T4SO1-HDT) Slip-On (Titanium)PART NUMBER: S-T4SO1-HDT Power: +0.7 kW at 8000 rpm Torque: +1.0 Nm at 6700 rpm Weight: -1.3 kg The neo-retro styling utilizes a muffler design first introduced thirty years ago and featuring many updates since then. This Slip-On Line (Titanium) perfectly integrates with the lines of the bike. It is constructed with a high-grade sandblasted titanium muffler outer sleeve, and the link pipe, end cap with imprints, heatshield, and muffler inner structure are all made from stainless steel. It is finished with a monochrome logo sticker and a heatshield to prevent burning or damage to the rider’s gear. During the development stage, emphasis was placed on throttle response and performance. It delivers increases in power and torque of 0.7 kW (0.9 hp) at 8,000 rpm and 1.0 Nm at 8,000 rpm, respectively, when compared to a Triumph equipped with a standard stock exhaust system and tested on the Akrapovič in-house dyno. Lightweight materials create a weight reduction of 39.5% (1.3 kg) against the standard stock system. This product has a deep and full sound. It is EC/ECE type approved and Euro5 compliant, and the straightforward plug-and-play installation means no remapping is needed. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 26.1 / 8000 rpm 26.4 / 8000 rpm + 0.7 / 8000 rpm HP (m) 35.5 / 8000 rpm 35.9 / 8000 rpm + 0.9 / 8000 rpm HP (i) 35 / 8000 rpm 35.4 / 8000 rpm + 0.9 / 8000 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 33.1 / 7000 rpm 33.7 / 6600 rpm + 1 / 6700 rpm Ib-ft 24.4 / 7000 rpm 24.9 / 6600 rpm + 0.7 / 6700 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.29 1.99 - 1.3 Ib 7.3 4.4 - 2.9 % - 39.5 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 20 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View Perfo