end cap with imprints, perfectly in keeping with the design of the exhaust. Weight has been reduced by 25.8% (0.8 kg), and power and torque increased by 0.5 kW (0.7 hp) at 5600 rpm and 1 Nm at 3000 rpm, respectively, when compared to a Honda GB350 equipped with a standard stock exhaust and measured on the in-house dyno. This product is a plug-and-play installation, with no remapping required. It meets EC/ECE type approval and emits a deep sound from the single-cylinder engine. It is designed so the stock heatshield can be installed. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 14 / 5800 rpm 14.3 / 5900 rpm + 0.5 / 5600 rpm HP (m) 19.1 / 5800 rpm 19.5 / 5900 rpm + 0.7 / 5600 rpm HP (i) 18.8 / 5800 rpm 19.2 / 5900 rpm + 0.7 / 5600 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 28.9 / 3200 rpm 29.3 / 3500 rpm + 1 / 3000 rpm Ib-ft 21.3 / 3200 rpm 21.6 / 3500 rpm + 0.7 / 3000 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.1 2.3 - 0.8 Ib 6.8 5.1 - 1.7 % - 25.8 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 30 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View AUS Approval: View AUS Approval: View ECE Type-Approval Certificate: View ECE Type-Approval Certificate: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.cc:T44f,ARROW Kawasaki ZX6R 636 (2019-2020) Pro Race Titanium Silencer with Welded Link Pipe (71898PR) PART NUMBER: 71898PR Features Values Silencer materia