formance. Enhance your Yezdi Scrambler’s identity by embracing the Red Rooster Celesta Scram Exhaust. Every twist of the throttle will resonate with the harmonious blend of power, torque, and the distinctive growl that defines the Scrambler’s character. Step into the realm of classic adventure riding by upgrading to the Red Rooster Celesta Scram Exhaust. Relish every mile, capture the essence of the open road, and journey with a sense of nostalgia and modern-day power. This exhaust isn’t just a product; it’s a fusion of heritage and innovation, capturing the heart of the Yezdi Scrambler and fueling your passion for timeless exploration. And let’s not forget, it’s equipped with advanced ceramic wool construction for optimal performance and durability, making it an exhaust built to conquer any adventure. Compatible with: Yezdi Scrambler. What you get: 1 Set of Silencers, Heat Shield, Extension pipe, Keychain, Sticker, Clamp, and Manual.41:T60b,About Red Rooster Performance Celesta Pro Exhaust for Jawa 42 2.1 – Polish Introducing the Red Rooster Celesta Pro Chrome (Polish) Exhaust – a masterpiece tailored exclusively for Jawa bikes. Elevate your Jawa experience with this exceptional exhaust that encapsulates power, innovation, and style in one harmonious package. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, the Celesta Pro exhaust is a true testament to precision. Engineered with the highest standards in mind, it enhances both performance and aesthetics, ensuring your Jawa bike stands out on every road. The Red Rooster Celesta Pro is built to perfection and features high-grade stainless steel (Grade 304), guaranteeing exceptional durability and resistance against the elements. This exhaust is not just an enhancement; it’s a promise of enduring quality and performance. Experience the true soul of your Jawa bike as the Red Rooster Celesta Pro exhaust elevates your journey with a symphony of power, torque, and the iconic thump that defines the Jawa spirit. Upgrade your ri