d Manual.43:Ta35,About Red Rooster Performance Stellar Header Pipe – Polish for Royal Enfield GT 650 and Interceptor 650. Introducing the perfect complement to our exceptional exhaust systems for the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT – our meticulously crafted Red Rooster Performance Brushed Steel (Matte) Stellar Header Pipes. Unlock the true potential of your ride with these high-performance additions engineered to redefine your biking experience. Designed with precision engineering, our Header Pipes are the key to unleashing untapped power and performance from your motorcycle. Engineered to be free-flowing, they effortlessly optimize the exhaust gas flow, resulting in a remarkable boost in both torque and horsepower. Feel the difference as your bike responds with enhanced agility, acceleration, and overall dynamism. Crafted exclusively from top-grade stainless steel, our Header Pipes boast unparalleled durability and longevity. This ensures they can withstand the rigors of the road while maintaining their striking appearance. The stainless steel construction guarantees longevity and enhances the pipes’ resistance to corrosion and heat, making them a reliable addition to your Royal Enfield. Product Highlights: Performance Unleashed: Our Header Pipes redefine your bike’s potential, delivering an impressive surge in torque and horsepower, translating to an exhilarating riding experience. Unrestricted Flow: The free-flow design optimizes exhaust gas movement, improving engine efficiency and enhancing overall performance. Stainless Steel Strength: Crafted from high-grade stainless steel, our Header Pipes combine strength, corrosion resistance, and heat resilience for lasting performance and aesthetics. Precision Engineering: Designed to fit the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT seamlessly, our Header Pipes guarantee a hassle-free installation process Upgrade your ride with our Stainless Steel Header Pipes, a testament to our commitment to 