nt on your Shotgun 650 will be elevated with the Red Rooster Performance Astral Exhaust. Embrace the essence of cruising in its truest form, and experience the sheer joy of the ride like never before. Upgrade to the Red Rooster Astral Exhaust and witness your Shotgun 650 charisma reach new heights, setting you apart as the king of the road. Unleash the spirit of adventure, embrace the power of the cruiser, and let the world know that you ride with the heart of a true explorer. This is more than just an exhaust; it’s an astral journey into the realm of unforgettable riding experiences.55:T749,Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes Set (Polish) – For Hunter 350 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Hunter 350 with the Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes Set, designed to deliver superior performance, enhanced exhaust flow, and a bold premium look. Crafted with precision and finished in a stunning high-polish shine, these header pipes transform both the style and ride quality of your motorcycle. Key Features: High-Quality Construction: Made from durable, heat-resistant materials for long-lasting performance. Improved Exhaust Flow: Optimized design helps reduce back pressure and supports better engine breathing. Enhanced Performance: Experience smoother throttle response and a noticeable power improvement. Premium Polish Finish: Gives your Hunter 350 a sleek, eye-catching and custom look. Perfect Fit for Hunter 350: Directly compatible with Royal Enfield Hunter 350 for easy installation. Corrosion & Heat Resistant: Built to handle tough riding conditions and long journeys. Why Choose Red Rooster? Red Rooster is known for delivering performance-oriented exhaust systems and components designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand quality, style, and reliability. This header pipe set ensures optimal performance without compromising engine safety. Benefits: Better sound output when paired with performance exhausts Enhanced engine efficiency Improved aesthetic appeal Lightweight and durable construction Compatibility: ✔ Royal Enfield Hunter 350 (All Variants) Package Includes: 1 x Pair of Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes (Polished) Installation-ready components Installation: This header pipe set is designed for easy fitment. Professional installation is recommended for best results and optimal performance. Give your Hunter 350 the performance boost and premium style it truly deserves with the Red Rooster Performance Header Pipes Set.56:T60f,Key Features: Deep, Throaty Sound Up to 10% Increase in Engine Performance Lightweight Build Rust-Free Durability Conquer Every Terrain – With the Red Rooster Performance Vertex Pro Exhaust for Royal Enfield Himalayan 450. Purpose-built for the wild, the Vertex Pro is precision-engineered to amplify your Himalayan 450’s true adventure potential. Crafted using premium Grade 304 stainless steel and high-temperature Resisting Imported Stitched Blanket, this exhaust system is designed to endure the harshest conditions while delivering consistent high performance. From steep climbs to open highways, the Vertex Pro optimizes exhaust flow, reduces backpressure, and sheds unnecessary weight – resulting in significantly improved throttle response, torque delivery, and top-end power. Whether you're riding through mountain passes or city streets, every twist of the wrist brings a surge of controlled aggression and unmistakable punch. What sets the Vertex Pro apart isn’t just performance – it's the signature exhaust note. A bold, deep, and commanding thump that complements the Himalayan 450’s rugged dual-sport character, giving your ride a voice that speaks volumes wherever the road takes you. Elevate your Himalayan experience with the Red Rooster Performance Vertex Pro – the perfect fusion of adventure-ready durability, tuned performance, and head-turning sound. Ride farther. Ride stronger. Ride with Red Rooster. Installation: Easy bolt-on installation that fits straight onto your existing setup with no big changes needed.57:T558,Silver Stallion Exhaust For Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT 650 Twin-Black Matte Experience unmatched performance with the Silver Stallion exhaust system, designed specifically for the Royal Enfield Interceptor and GT 650 Twin. This high-performance exhaust delivers a noticeable power and torque boost, while its durable design ensures longevity and optimal performance under all conditions. Performance Boost:- +2 BHP increase in horsepower +4.9 NM torque surge Specifications & Features:- First in India with Low Temperature Radiant Technology Highly Water-Resistant – durable in all weather conditions No loss of wool – ensures long-lasting performance No change in sound – retains the authentic Royal Enfield character Switchable Sound Baffle – toggle between loud and quiet modes without compromising performance Distinctive Exhaust Note – tuned for a unique and aggressive tone No Exhaust Drone – smooth and refined auditory experience Design & Build:- Easy Installation – precision fit, no modifications needed Weight Reduction – improves handling and performance Exhaust Weight: Only 5.5 kg Material: High-grade SS304 Stainless Steel Perfect Weight Distribution – enhances bike balance and maneuverability Sporty, Aggressive Design – complements the aesthetics of the Interceptor and GT 650 Available in Variations:- Polish Matte Matt Black58:T52a,Silver Stallion Exhaust For Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT 650 Twin-Brushed finishes Experience unmatched performance with the Silver Stallion exhaust system, designed specifically for the Royal Enfield Interceptor and GT 650 Twin. This high-performance exhaust delivers a noticeable power and torque boost, while its durable design ensures longevity and optimal performance under all conditions. Performance Upgrade: +2 BHP power boost +4.9 NM torque surge Key Features: India’s First with Low Temperature Radiant Coating – optimized for heat control Highly Water-Resistant – suitable for all-weather riding No Wool Loss – long-te