ike's sound and performance. Key Features: Slightly Thicker Construction: The TE 102 Megaphone has a slightly fatter construction compared to the TE 101, giving it a more robust presence while maintaining its classic megaphone shape. This adds a unique look to your Interceptor GT 650 or GT 650, enhancing the bike’s overall styling. Matt Polished Stainless Steel: Crafted from high-quality stainless steel with a matt polish finish, the TE 102 offers a sleek, modern look while ensuring exceptional durability. The material resists corrosion and provides long-lasting performance. Weight Reduction: The AEW TE 102 Megaphone reduces bike weight by 4.5 kg, making it a lightweight alternative to the stock silencer. This weight reduction helps improve handling, responsiveness, and overall bike performance. Enhanced Bottom and Mid-Range Torque: Designed to optimize bottom and mid-range torque, the TE 102 offers better power delivery, giving your bike a more responsive throttle and smoother acceleration, especially when cruising or navigating city streets. Signature Rumble Sound: One of the standout features of the TE 102 is its signature rumble sound. You'll notice a deep, throaty exhaust note, especially when downshifting or braking. This iconic sound is sure to turn heads and add character to your ride. Removable DB Killer: The TE 102 comes with an easily removable decibel (DB) killer, allowing you to fine-tune the exhaust sound to your preference. Whether you want a more subdued tone or an aggressive growl, this feature gives you flexibility. Retro Styling: With its retro-inspired design, the TE 102 Megaphone adds a classic touch to your bike while keeping it stylishly modern. It perfectly complements the Interceptor GT 650 and GT 650’s aesthetics, enhancing its visual appeal. Slip-On Mounting: The TE 102 is designed as a direct-fit slip-on exhaust, making installation quick and easy without the need for modifications. Product Specifications: Material: High-quality stainless steel with a matt polish finish Weight Reduction: Reduces bike weight by 4.5 kg Sound: Signature rumble sound, especially noticeable during downshifting and braking Torque: Improved bottom and mid-range torque for enhanced performance DB Killer: Includes a removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer Fitment: Direct fit slip-on exhaust for easy installation Design: Retro-inspired styling for a classic look Dimensions: 56 × 23 × 13 cm Weight: 6.5 kg Why Choose the AEW TE 102 Megaphone for Interceptor GT 650 / GT 650? Improved Performance: The exhaust’s design optimizes bottom and mid-range torque, improving throttle response and overall rideability. Signature Exhaust Sound: Enjoy the signature rumble sound that makes your bike stand out on the road. Whether you’re downshifting or braking, the sound adds a distinct presence to your ride. Weight Reduction: Reducing the overall weight by 4.5 kg, the TE 102 enhances your bike's handling and performance. Retro Aesthetic: The retro-inspired design elevates the styling of your Interceptor GT 650 or GT 650, giving it a unique, classic look. Durability: Made from stainless steel, the TE 102 is resistant to corrosion and is built for long-lasting performance. Easy Installation: The slip-on mounting system makes installation hassle-free, ensuring a perfect fit without modifications. The AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Matt Polish is a high-performance exhaust silencer that brings a perfect blend of style, performance, and sound to your Interceptor GT 650 or GT 650. With its sleek, retro-inspired design, signature rumble sound, and 4.5 kg weight reduction, the TE 102 enhances your bike’s appearance, sound, and performance. It is an easy-to-install upgrade that delivers improved torque, better throttle response, and a distinctive exhaust note, making it a must-have for riders seeking to elevate their bike’s overall riding experience. Note: AEW Product Availability & Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW product