nce noticeable gains in throttle response, torque delivery, and overall engine performance. No ECU remap required — plug and play. Premium Build Quality: Crafted from SS304 stainless steel, the Blaze exhaust is rust-proof, heat-resistant, and built to last. Imported 3-B Glass Wool Blanket Insulation: Designed with an imported stitched thermal insulation blanket for optimal heat resistance and performance stability. Lightweight Design: Weighs only 2.4 kg, significantly lighter than stock exhausts with resonators (typically over 10 kg). Crisp & Deep Exhaust Note: Delivers a sharp, performance-driven sound profile that enhances your riding experience without being overly loud. Slip-On Fitment with DB Killer: Hassle-free installation with a removable DB killer, offering flexibility in sound and performance. Visual Appeal: Sleek angular design that complements the Triumph Speed 400’s aggressive stance. Lifetime Warranty on Exhaust Body: Confidence and reliability backed by Red Rooster’s commitment to quality. Performance Advantages: Up to 10% engine performance gain across the RPM range Freer-revving engine with improved exhaust flow Enhanced throttle response and torque delivery Ride-ready out of the box – no tuning required Built-in premium insulation for superior heat management Comparison: Blaze vs. Stock/Other Exhausts:- Feature Blaze Exhaust Stock/Other Exhausts Exhaust Type Slip-on with DB Killer Slip-on with Resonator Design Angular & Premium Routine Design Sound Profile Crisp & Deep Note Mild Thump Weight 2.4 kg Over 10 kg Build Quality SS304 Stainless Steel SS304 Stainless Steel Thermal Insulation Imported Stitched Blanket Basic Glass Wool Warranty Lifetime on Exhaust Body No Warranty Where Raw Horsepower Meets Triumph Finesse. Level up your Speed 400 with Blaze — the performance upgrade that delivers on power, design, and durability in one clean package.7a:T8ed,Red Rooster Performance-Blaze Premium Exhaust system For Triumph Speed 400 (Polish) Engineered for S