 SC-Project S1 exhaust is a tapered exhaust with a large outlet diameter for enhanced exhaust air flow. The S1 performance is based off of technology directly developed in World Superbike racing. The silencer body features a conical shape for proper back pressure and optimal ground clearance during extreme lean angles. Aeronautical grade materials Large diameter exhaust outlet Bike specific exhaust mounting hardware included 24 month factory defect warranty Race Replica Carbon fiber heat shield Technical Features Line Slip-On Link pipe Material Titanium Body Material Titanium End Cap Material Carbon Outlet diameter Ø52mm dB-Killer Yes Frame attachment Welded bracketv Homologation – EC, TUV approved Yes - street legal - EURO 4 Approval Certificate Yes Weight -2,85 Kg (Stock 4,1 Kg / SC 1,25 Kg) Power + 3,5 hp @8250 rpm Torque + 2,8 Nm @8250 rpm Features Exhaust Version EURO 4 - Street Legal Exhaust Finish Titanium, Matte Black Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Slip-on Exhaust dB Killer Yes Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Z900 / 2020, Kawasaki / Z900 / 2021, Kawasaki / Z900 / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts & Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.b6:T767,SC PROJECT 4-2-1 HEADERS FOR KAWASAKI Z900 Kawasaki Z900 PART NUMBER: K25/34-SS-FS Product Description If you want the best in performance and lightness for your Kawasaki Z900, you have to choose the full system. The complete SC-Project groupset is the direct result of the research, development and design work started by the in-house R&D department together with the major MotoGP and SBK championship teams. It is available in full titanium or AISI 304 stainless steel versions - compatible with the entire range of slip-on mufflers dedicated to the motorcycle for which it was designed. The SC-Project full system is designed to house the original lambda sensor. The removal of the original catalytic converter allows an important reduction of the operating temperature as well as giving a deep and gloomy sound to your Z900, the true distinctive mark of the SC-Project range. Available in full titanium or stainless steel AISI 304 CNC machined from solid billet titanium for perfect fitting Best performance improvement both in power and in torque OEM decat headers Stock O2 sensor housing 4-2-1 Design Features PART NUMBER K25-SS-FS Exhaust Type Headers Only Header Material Stainless Steel, Titanium Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Z900 / 2019, Kawasaki / Z900 / 2018, Kawasaki / Z900 / 2017 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts & Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.b7:T7fa,SC PROJECT S1 Exhaust For Triumph Street Triple 765 Triumph Street Triple 765 PART NUMBER: T18-LTS41T Product Description The S1 muffler, a benchmark for the Superbike World Championship, is available with a titanium tapered body and matt carbon fibre end cap and, depending on the model of motorcycle, with the spectacular titanium flame arrester on the output. The S1 muffler fuses a racing style with valued technical solutions such as bracket and fitting welding with T.I.G. technology or titanium insert bushings machined from solid by CNC machines, which guarantee impeccable couplings. The S1's tapered body, together with the diameter of the output and the particular internal soundproofing, gives the bike on which it is fitted a dark and unmistakable sound. Aeronautical grade materials Large diameter exhaust outlet Bike specific exhaust mounting hardware included 24 month factory defect warranty Race Replica Noise data: 103 dB @ 5850 rpm (with dB-Killer on) 109 dB @ 5850 rpm (without dB-Killer) Features PART NUMBER T18-LTS41T Exhaust Finish Titanium, Matte Black Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Slip-on Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium dB Killer Yes Make/Model/Year Triumph / Street Triple R 765 / 2020, Triumph / Street Triple R 765 / 2021, Triumph / Street Triple R 765 / 2022, Triumph / Street Triple RS 765 / 2020, Triumph / Street Triple RS 765 / 2021, Triumph / Street Triple RS 765 / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts & Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.b8:T5b9,SC PROJECT S1 Exhaust For Kawasaki Zx10R Kawasaki Zx10R (2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET41T Product Description SC-Project is a race tested and race proven Italian exhaust manufacturer. SC-Project uses their MotoGP, Moto3, Moto2 and Superbike racing experience to push the limits and develop the highest level of exhaust performance. The SC-Project S1 exhaust is a tapered exhaust with a large outlet diameter for enhanced exhaust air flow. The S1 performance is based off of technology directly developed in World Superbike racing. The silencer body features a conical shape for proper back pressure and optimal ground clearance during extreme lean angles. Features Line Slip-On Link pipe Material Titanium Body Material Titanium End Cap Material Carbon Outlet diameter Ø70 mm Frame attachment Welded bracket dB-Killer No Racing FOR RACING USE ONLY Weight -6,55 Kg (Stock 7,5 Kg / SC 0,95 Kg) Noise level 124 dB at 7000 rpm IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.b9:T9c2,SC PROJECT SC1 R Exhaust For Kawasaki Zx10R Kawasaki Zx10R (2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET91T Product Description SC-Project is a race tested and race proven Italian exhaust manufacturer. SC-Project uses their MotoGP, Moto3, Moto2 and Superbike racing experience to push the limits and develop the highest level of exhaust performance. SC-Project exhausts are hand made right along side the same exhausts you see on MotoGP bikes and at race tracks around the world. SC-Project is committed to putting race quality performance, sound and weight reduction in the hands of all motorcycle enthusiasts. SC1-R silencer has been studied and developed by SC-Project R&D department, to be the new benchmark for World Superbike Championship. The diamond hexagonal shaped body is made in full titanium and the outlet is in matte carbon fiber that gives to the SC1-R an aggressive racing look. The new SC1-R is the perfect synthesis of SC-Project mission: study and produce exhaust for the best race teams in Superbike and MotoGP. Performance, weight reduction and sound with the excellence of a product made in Italy. Aeronautical grade materials Large diameter exhaust outlet Bike specific exhaust mounting hardware included 24 month factory defect warranty Optimized exhaust shape for high lean angles Titanium Decat Link Pipe Weight : - 5 Kg (Stock 7,5 Kg / SC 2,5 Kg) Noise level : 106 dB at 7000 rpm (WITH DB-KILLER) 113 dB at 7000 rpm (WITHOUT DB-KILLER) Features PART NUMBER K38-DET91T Exhaust Version Race Version Exhaust Finish Matte Carbon Fiber, Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Half System Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium Titanium Mesh on Exhaust Outlet Yes dB Killer Yes Sound dB Rating 106 dB @ 7000 rpm (with dB-Killer) Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2022, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts & Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.ba:T859,SC PROJECT SC1 R Carbon Exhaust For Kawasaki Zx10R Kawasaki Zx10R (2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET91C Product Description The muffler SC1-R is created and developed by the experience of the SC-Project racing department in the most important World Competitions. A look with taut and decided lines will enrich Your Kawasaki Ninja ZX-10R making it unique and exclusive. The exit pipe obtained by hydroforming and the carbon fiber end cap from the rhomboidal asymmetric shape make inimitable the silencer SC1-R. The lightweight outer body is available in Carbon version. The weldings with T.I.G., the sound-absorbing material resistant to very high temperatures and the insert bushings made in CNC machining embellish the SC1-R silencer. In the version Carbon on the silencer is applied an insert with the SC-Project logo as in the versions of our mufflers used in Competitions. In the kit are included the full titanium link pipe and the carbon heat protection. Weight : 5 Kg (Stock 7,5 Kg / SC 2,5 Kg) Noise level : L106 dB at 7000 rpm (WITH DB-KILLER) 113 dB at 7000 rpm (WITHOUT DB-KILLER) Features PART NUMBER K38-DET91C Exhaust Version Race Version Exhaust Finish Matte Carbon Fiber, Titanium Exhaust End Cap Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust Type Half System Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium Titanium Mesh on Exhaust Outlet Yes dB Killer Yes Sound dB Rating 106 dB @ 7000 rpm (with dB-Killer) Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2021, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10RR / 2022, Kawasaki / Ninja ZX-10R / 2022 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts & Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.bb:T85b,SC PROJECT CR-T CARBON EXHAUST FOR KAWASAKI ZX10R KAWASAKI ZX10R2021-22) PART NUMBER: K38-DET36C Product Description SC-Project is a race tested and race proven Italian exhaust manufacturer. SC-Projec