ue Akrapovič sound. Everything packed in stylishly designed Slip-On exhaust systems. The result of taking design very seriously is a beautifully crafted exhaust system with a carbon fibre muffler outer sleeve and end cap. Race-proven materials. In combination with optional headers, we recommend to use the noise insert that comes with the slip-on system in order to achieve the best possible performance. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 32.6 / 10300 33.9 / 10300 + 1.8 / 11000 HP (m) 44.3 / 10300 46.1 / 10300 + 2.4 / 11000 HP (i) 43.7 / 10300 45.4 / 10300 + 2.4 / 11000 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 35.8 / 8100 36.1 / 8200 +1.1 / 3300 Ib-ft 26.4 / 8100 26.6 / 8200 + 0.8 / 3300 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 4.08 1.69- 2.4 - 2.4 Ib 9 3.7- 5.3 - 5.3 % - 58.6 Volume UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Volume dB 86.6 / 5000 94 / 5000 7.4 Inst. time: Min 20 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.c1:T763,AKRAPOVIC KAWASAKI NINJA ZX 10R (2021-2022) Slip-On Line (Carbon)PART NUMBER: S-K10SO27-HRC Power +0.4 kW at 11300 rpm Torque +0.6 Nm at 11300 rpm Weight -0.7 kg This race-inspired hexagonal muffler is made from beautifully crafted carbon fibre while the updated end cap is now made out of light-weight titanium. The EC-ECE type-a