he silencer body features a conical shape for proper back pressure and optimal ground clearance during extreme lean angles. Weight:-2,85 Kg (Stock 4,1 Kg / SC 1,25 Kg) Power:+3,5 hp @8250 rpm Torque:+2,8 Nm @8250 rpm Features PART NUMBER K34-T36TR Exhaust Version EURO 4 - Street Legal Exhaust Finish Titanium, Matte Carbon Fiber Exhaust End Cap Titanium Exhaust Type Slip-on Exhaust Link Pipe Material Titanium Titanium Mesh on Exhaust Outlet Yes dB Killer Yes Make/Model/Year Kawasaki / Z900 / 2020Kawasaki / Z900 / 2021Kawasaki / Z900 / 2022Kawasaki / Z900 / 2023 Sold Per Kit Product Exhausts & Air Filters Brand SC-Project IMPORTANT NOTE: SC PROJECT PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WHATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. SC PROJECT products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.d2:T805,AKRAPOVIC KAWASAKI Z900 2021Optional Header (SS)PART NUMBER: E-K9R4 Power +5.1 kW at 9850 rpm Torque +4.7 Nm at 7000 rpm Weight -4.4 kg The performance of the Slip-On Line exhausts can be further enhanced with the addition of the optional stainless-steel header. When this beautifully finished header is added to any Slip-On Line exhaust for the Z900, it turns the muffler into a complete racing system and increases power to even greater levels of enjoyment. The addition of the header will also improve the sound of the exhaust, giving it a crisper racing tone. The product is developed and tested on EU vehicle specification. Non-EU fitment and performance may vary by marketplace and different vehicle specification. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA 