e and a more classic rear endcap, finished with a durable titanium muffler sleeve and robust carbon-fiber clamp. No fuel remapping is required, but for optimal performance use a fuel controller. A combination of beautiful machines and hand welds. Patented hexagonal muffler. Integrated titanium exhaust hanger. CNC machined muffler inlet cap. Optimized to maximize lean angle. All carbon fiber parts are produced in-house. Air-tight quality controlled production means your exhaust will be perfect.\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"128000.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/Akrapovic-HONDA-Africa-Twin-Adventure-Sports-Racing-Line-Titanium-2020-Exhaust-Riders-Junction.png?v=1787335740\",\"altText\":\"Akrapovic HONDA Africa Twin Adventure Sports Racing Line Titanium 2020+ Exhaust\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52911733670205\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"128000.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":null,\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Akrapovic\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[\"Akrapovic Accessories\"],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Akrapovic\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\",\"tags\":[\"Akrapovic Accessories\"],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\"}},\"inventoryQuantity\":\"$undefined\",\"inventoryTracked\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10478235877693\",\"handle\":\"akrapovic-honda-cb-300-r-slip-on-line-carb