;n.push=n;n.loaded=!0;n.version='2.0';\\n            n.queue=[];t=b.createElement(e);t.async=!0;\\n            t.src=v;s=b.getElementsByTagName(e)[0];\\n            s.parentNode.insertBefore(t,s)}(window, document,'script',\\n            'https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/fbevents.js');\\n            fbq('init', '1234567890');\\n            fbq('track', 'PageView');\\n          \"}]\n15:300\n17:true\n15:C\n16:0\n14:\"$undefined\"\n","/collections/$d$handle/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:T867,Red Rooster Performance Header Pipe for Royal Enfield Super Meteor 650 Polish Finish Enhance the performance and sound of your Royal Enfield Super Meteor 650 with the Red Rooster Performance Header Pipe in a premium polish finish. Designed for riders who demand better exhaust flow, improved power, and a deep throaty exhaust note, this high-performance header pipe is the perfect upgrade for your motorcycle. Boost Performance & Exhaust Efficiency This performance header pipe for Royal Enfield Super Meteor 650 is engineered to optimize exhaust flow, resulting in up to 10% increase in engine performance. Experience smoother acceleration, improved throttle response, and enhanced overall ride quality. Deep Throaty Exhaust Sound Enjoy a rich, deep, and aggressive exhaust note that enhances your riding experience. The Red Rooster header pipe delivers a signature sound that stands out while maintaining refined acoustics. Premium Build Quality Lightweight Construction – Improves power-to-weight ratio Rust-Free Durability – Built with corrosion-resistant materials for long life High-Quality Polish Finish – Premium shine with superior durability Easy Bolt-On Installation This Royal Enfield Super Meteor 650 header pipe features a direct bolt-on design, allowing hassle-free installation with your existing setup. No major modifications are required, making it a convenient upgrade for all riders. Warranty Information Black Finish – 6 Months Warranty Polish & Matte Finish – Lifetime Warranty Why Choose Red Rooster Performance Header Pipe? Increased Engine Performance up to 10% Enhanced Exhaust Sound – Deep and throaty tone Durable & Rust-Resistant Build Perfect Fit for Super Meteor 650 Easy Installation with no complex modifications Conclusion The Red Rooster Performance Header Pipe for Royal Enfield Super Meteor 650 is a must-have upgrade for riders seeking better performance, premium sound, and long-lasting durability. Elevate your riding experience with improved power delivery and an aggressive exhaust note. Upgrade your Super Meteor 650 today with a high-performance header pipe designed for power, sound, and style.4:T65a,Red Rooster Blaze Header Pipes (Polish) for Triumph Scrambler 400X Enhance your motorcycle’s performance with the Red Rooster Blaze Header Pipes for Triumph Scrambler 400X, designed to deliver improved exhaust flow, better engine efficiency, and a more responsive ride. Built for performance enthusiasts, these header pipes are the perfect upgrade for both city riding and long-distance touring. Crafted with a lightweight and durable construction, these header pipes feature a premium polished finish that adds a sleek and aggressive look to your motorcycle while ensuring long-lasting, rust-free performance. Key Features of Red Rooster Blaze Header Pipes Performance Enhancement: Delivers up to 10% improvement in engine performance with optimized exhaust flow. Lightweight Construction: Reduces overall weight for better handling and efficiency. Rust-Free Durability: Built with high-quality materials to ensure long-lasting, corrosion-resistant performance. Premium Polish Finish: Enhances the bike’s appearance with a clean and sporty look. Direct Fit Design: Engineered specifically for Triumph Scrambler 400X. Installation Easy bolt-on installation allows seamless fitment with your existing setup without requiring major modifications. Designed for quick and hassle-free installation. Why Choose Red Rooster, Blaze Header Pipes? This upgrade is ideal for riders looking for a motorcycle performance exhaust solution that enhances power, reduces weight, and improves overall riding experience. It delivers a perfect balance of performance, durability, and style. Compatibility Suitable Bike: Triumph Scrambler 400X5:T4af,Introducing the game-changer – The Red Rooster Performance Stellar Exhaust for RE Shotgun 650, crafted to perfection with the finest stainless steel (Grade 304) and advanced ceramic wool for maximum performance and durability. Elevate your riding experience to new heights as this exhaust transforms your bike’s performance by optimizing airflow and shedding unnecessary weight. Get ready to feel the power like never before! With our Stellar exhaust, brace yourself for a surge in torque, an electrifying throttle response, and an impressive boost in horsepower across the entire rev range. Each twist of the throttle will be met with unmatched precision and exhilaration. But that’s not all – the Red Rooster Performance Exhaust doesn’t just enhance performance. It also adds a captivating and aggressive sporty thump, showcasing the true character of the Shotgun 650’s parallel-twin engine. It’s more than just an upgrade; it’s an expression of pure adrenaline! Step up your riding game with the Red Rooster Performance Stellar Exhaust – where power, style, and the heart-pounding beat of the road converge into one thrilling symphony! Experience power at play with Red Rooster!6:T4fe,The Ashu Engineering Works Himalayan 411 is a free flow, slip-on exhaust system that has been painstakingly crafted and engineered to perfectly match Royal Enfield’s Himalayan 411 Adventure bike. The Himalayan exhaust provides the bike a medium tone thump while working to provide you with increased bottom to mid-range performance at the throttle. The AEW Himalayan 411 is available in a choice of heat resistant black coated mild steel or 304-grade stainless steel. Features: For Royal Enfield Himalayan 411 Free Flow with ceramic wool for better performance Enhanced mid range and bottom end torque, Deep loud thump Exported and sold worldwide, Thousands of satisfied customer International world class Quality Heat Resistant black coating up to 600'C, End cap in Stainless Steel matt finished. Note: AEW Product Availability & Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-93007207897:T4e4,Product Description Featuring a full titanium link pipe and no pre-muffler, this beautifully shaped exhaust is perfectly matched to the character of the engine and delivers a sharper sound. With a strong power gain through the entire rpm range, improved torque, and reduced weight, this exhaust is sure to take the Monster 797 to the next performance level. The unique exhaust system, with its Grand Prix–inspired conical pipes, imparts a powerful classic appearance, and the outer sleeves are coated black for a sporty, uncompromising look. Specially designed removable noise-reduction inserts have been created to give the bike a dual character and offer a choice between two different soundtracks for the machine. With the inserts in place, the exhaust system is suitable for everyday use, but when removed the sound levels rise, making it perfect for special occasions. No fuel remapping is required, but for optimal performance use a fuel controller A combination of beautiful machine and hand welds Patented hexagonal muffler Integrated titanium exhaust hanger CNC machined muffler inlet cap Optimized to maximize lean angle All carbon fiber parts are produced in-house Air-tight quality controlled production means your exhaust will be perfect8:T4e9,Product Description This is a complete system constructed from high-grade, race-proven lightweight titanium alloys. It provides an impressive increase in power across the entire rev range while also improving torque delivery. The weight is decreased by over 6 kg. The system is finished with a hand-crafted carbon-fiber hexagonal muffler – inspired by Jonathan Rea’s (Kawasaki Racing Team) World Superbike–winning machine. The power level has been increased with an extra 8.2 kW (11 HP), recorded on Akrapovič’s in-house dyno with back-to-back tests of the Kawasaki with an Evolution Line (Titanium) exhaust and a Ninja ZX-10RR with a standard stock exhaust system. The exhaust delivers a unique, deep, sporty sound that enhances the system’s sporty heritage. An optional aluminum muffler bracket is available to further complement the entire system. Features: No fuel remapping is required, but for optimal performance use a fuel controller. A combination of beautiful machines and hand welds. Patented hexagonal muffler. Integrated titanium exhaust hanger. CNC machined muffler inlet cap. Optimized to maximize lean angle. All carbon fiber parts are produced in-house. Air-tight quality controlled production means your exhaust will be perfect.9:T538,Product Description Loaded with the below features: Founded by Giorgione Gillian in 1985, Arrow is now one the most respected brands of motorcycle exhausts in the world, with several bike racing titles under its belt. By refusing to compromise on their philosophy of quality through craftsmanship, Arrow continues to produce handmade exhaust systems that offer both performance and reliability. Just use the ‘your bike’ selector to find the right exhaust to fit your machine. A 20-years-lasting experience witnesses that Arrow Exhaust is a dynamic-driven company, with a young mind headed towards the things to come in the next future. we’re among the most important companies in this market. Arrow’s exhaust technologies are a direct result of their research and development through racing in MotoGP, Moto2, Moto3, World SuperBike, and countless Endure Rallies. Research in races has always had a strong effect on Arrow Exhaust’s products, leading to the development of a new line of systems for the most powerful Sport-bikes and of a new line of exhausts for maxi scooters. All the products are being developed together with European Certification Companies. In 2007 Arrow Exhaust got the approval for its Environmental Management System, according to ISO 14001 standards. Fitment: DUCATI Scrambler 800 Desert Sled 2017-2020a:T52a,Product Description Loaded with the below features: Founded by Giorgione Gillian in 1985, Arrow is now one the most respected brands of motorcycle exhausts in the world, with several bike racing titles under its belt. By refusing to compromise on their philosophy of quality through craftsmanship, Arrow continues to produce handmade exhaust systems that offer both performance and reliability. Just use the ‘your bike’ selector to find the right exhaust to fit your machine. A 20-years-lasting experience witnesses that Arrow Exhaust is a dynamic-driven company, with a young mind headed towards the things to come in the next future. we’re among the most important companies in this market. Arrow’s exhaust technologies are a direct result of their research and development through racing in MotoGP, Moto2, Moto3, World SuperBike, and countless Endure Rallies. Research in races has always had a strong effect on Arrow Exhaust’s products, leading to the development of a new line of systems for the most powerful Sport-bikes and of a new line of exhausts for maxi scooters. All the products are being developed together with European Certification Companies. In 2007 Arrow Exhaust got the approval for its Environmental Management System, according to ISO 14001 standards. Fitment : Kawasaki Ninja 300 2016-21.b:T505,Product Description Loaded with the below features: Founded by Giorgione Gillian in 1985, Arrow is now one the most respected brands of motorcycle exhausts in the world, with several bike racing titles under its belt. By refusing to compromise on their philosophy of quality through craftsmanship, Arrow continues to produce handmade exhaust systems that offer both performance and reliability. Just use the ‘your bike’ selector to find the right exhaust to fit your machine. A 20-years-lasting experience witnesses that Arrow Exhaust is a dynamic-driven company, with a young mind headed towards the things to come in the next future. we’re among the most important companies in this market. Arrow’s exhaust technologies are a direct result of their research and development through racing in MotoGP, Moto2, Moto3, World Super Bike, and countless Enduro Rallies. Research in races has always had a strong effect on Arrow Exhaust’s products, leading to the development of a new line of systems for the most powerful Sport-bikes and of a new line of exhausts for maxi scooters. All the products are being developed together with European Certification Companies. In 2007 Arrow Exhaust got the approval for its Environmental Management System, according to ISO 14001 standards.c:T84f,AEW TE103 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Heat Resistance Black - Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT650 The AEW TE103 Megaphone Silencer is a bold upgrade for the Royal Enfield Interceptor/GT650, offering a distinct retro style with enhanced performance. Similar to the TE102, the TE103 features a slightly shorter reverse cone length and a larger inner perforated tube diameter, boosting power and grunt. It comes with a heat shield to conceal the silencer mounts, elevating the overall look of your bike. Made from high-quality stainless steel with a heat-resistant black finish and lightweight sound-damping insulation, the TE103 reduces the bike's weight by 4.5 kg while providing better bottom and mid-range torque. This exhaust is a direct, easy-fit slip-on, enhancing both the look and performance of your bike with a slimmer profile compared to the original. A signature feature of the TE103 is its signature rumble, which is especially noticeable when downshifting or braking. The exhaust also includes a removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer for customizable sound. Key Features: Material: Stainless Steel Heat Resistance Black Compatible with: Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT650 Improved performance with better bottom and mid-range torque Heat shield to conceal silencer mounts Reduces bike weight by 4.5 kg Signature rumble sound on downshifts and braking Slimmer profile for enhanced styling Easily removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer Weight: 4.5 kg Dimensions: 56 × 26 × 13 cm The TE103 is a perfect balance of performance, sound, and style, offering a distinctive retro look while improving the overall riding experience. Note: AEW Product Availability & Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-9300720789d:T8d1,AEW TE 101 Megaphone Interceptor / GT 650 - Stainless Steel Matt Polish The AEW TE 101 Megaphone Exhaust is a premium upgrade for the Royal Enfield Interceptor and GT 650, crafted from high-quality stainless steel and finished in a sleek matt polish. This exhaust not only enhances the bike’s aesthetics but also delivers improved performance, reducing bike weight by 4.5 kg while providing better bottom and mid-range torque for a more responsive and dynamic ride. The slip-on mounting system ensures an easy installation, and the slimmer profile compared to the original exhaust enhances the bike’s styling. A signature feature of the TE 101 is its deep rumble, which becomes especially noticeable during downshifting and braking. Additionally, the exhaust comes with a removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer, allowing you to adjust the sound to your preference. Designed with a retro look in mind, the TE 101 Megaphone Exhaust is also available in chrome-plated or black heat-resistant mild steel (limited warranty for the mild steel version), providing options for different rider preferences. Key Features: Material: Stainless Steel Matt Polish Compatible with: Royal Enfield Interceptor / GT 650 Reduces bike weight by 4.5 kg Improved bottom and mid-range torque Slip-on mounting for easy installation Slimmer profile for enhanced styling Signature rumble sound on downshifting and braking Removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer Retro-inspired design Also available in chrome-plated or heat-resistant black mild steel Weight: 5.2 kg Dimensions: 56 × 13 × 26 cm The AEW TE 101 Megaphone Exhaust is the ideal upgrade for those seeking a blend of performance, style, and sound, all wrapped in a sleek, retro-inspired design for the Interceptor and GT 650. Note: AEW Product Availability & Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-9300720789e:T615,About Red Rooster Performance Celesta Pro Exhaust for Yezdi Roadster – Chrome Polish Introducing the Red Rooster Celesta Pro Chrome (Polish) Exhaus