perience. Unrestricted Flow: The free-flow design optimizes exhaust gas movement, improving engine efficiency and enhancing overall performance. Stainless Steel Strength: Crafted from high-grade stainless steel, our Header Pipes combine strength, corrosion resistance, and heat resilience for lasting performance and aesthetics. Precision Engineering: Designed to fit the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT seamlessly, our Header Pipes guarantee a hassle-free installation process Upgrade your ride with our Stainless Steel Header Pipes, a testament to our commitment to engineering excellence and performance enhancement. Experience the thrill of unrestricted power and transform your Royal Enfield into a force to be reckoned with. Don’t just ride – command the road. Upgrade today and witness the true potential of your bike. Disclaimer: Due to extended use and exposure to great engine temperatures, it is normal for the exhaust to gain a faint golden tint. Compatible with: Royal Enfield Continental GT 650 and Interceptor 650. What you get: 1 Set Header Pipe, Clamps, Keychain, Sticker, and Manual. Additional Information:- Weight (Kg) Length (cm) Breadth (cm) Height (cm) 7 88 42 1519:T79e,About Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust for KTM Duke 250/390 (BS6) Introducing the Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust – an extraordinary addition to the KTM Duke 250/390, designed to transform these cornering hooligans into true marvels of power and performance. Elevate your riding experience with an exhaust that redefines sound, style, and the thrill of every ride. Crafted with precision and passion, the Galactic Exhaust isn’t just a modification; it’s a masterpiece that enhances both sound and ride quality. Designed to complement the aggressive nature of the Duke series perfectly, it delivers an unmatched combination of power, precision, and style. Constructed with the highest standards in mind, the Red Rooster Galactic boasts the pinnacle of stainless steel craftsmanship (Grade 304), ensuring unparalleled durability and resistance to the rigours of the road. But that’s not all – the advanced ceramic wool construction takes it a step further, optimizing exhaust flow and thermal resistance for an exhilarating riding experience. Embrace the true spirit of riding with the Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust. Feel the pulse of power, the precision of handling, and the roar of performance like never before. Every twist and turn will resonate with the harmonious blend of torque, horsepower, and the distinctive growl that defines the Duke’s character. Upgrade your Duke 250/390 to the Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust and discover an exceptional ride. Embrace the thrill, conquer the corners, and ignite the roads with a symphony of power and precision. This isn’t just an exhaust; it’s a fusion of technology, artistry, and adrenaline. Experience the galaxies of riding with the ultimate upgrade – the Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust. Note: For the 250/390, the resonator is removed for the bend pipe installation. Compatible with: Duke 250/390. What you get: 1 Silencer, Bend Pipe, Aluminium Sleeve, Clamps, Keychain, Sticker, and Manual.1a:T79e,About Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust for KTM Duke 250/390 (BS4) Introducing the Red Rooster Galactic Exhaust – an extraordinary addition to the KTM Duke 250/390, designed to transform these cornering hooligans into true marvels of power and performance. Elevate your riding experience with an exhaust that redefines sound, style, and the thrill of every ride. Crafted with precision and passion, the Galactic Exhaust isn’t just a modification; it’s a masterpiece that enhances both sound and ride quality. Designed to complement the aggressive nature of the Duke series perfectly, it delivers an unmatched combination of power, precision, and style. Constructed with the highest standards in mind, the Red Rooster Galactic boasts the pinnacle of stainless steel craftsmanship (Grade 304), ensuring unparalleled durability and resistance to the rigours