st note. The thump adds a noticeable presence without overwhelming the riding experience. Enhanced Bottom to Mid-Range Performance: The exhaust is engineered to optimize bottom to mid-range power, enhancing throttle response and offering smoother acceleration. This boost in power ensures a more dynamic and responsive ride, whether you're navigating city streets or cruising on the open road. Free Flow Design: With its free-flow exhaust design, the AEW Performance Full System minimizes exhaust restrictions, allowing gases to flow more freely. This leads to improved engine efficiency, greater power output, and enhanced throttle response. 304-Grade Stainless Steel Construction: Constructed from 304-grade stainless steel, the AEW Performance Full System is built for durability, corrosion resistance, and long-lasting performance. The matt polish finish gives the exhaust a sleek, modern look that complements the Guerrilla 450’s rugged design. Full System Exhaust: Unlike a slip-on system, the AEW Performance Full System replaces the entire exhaust setup, including headers and mid-pipe, providing more significant performance improvements. The full system ensures a smoother exhaust flow and optimized power delivery for a truly upgraded ride. Designed for Guerrilla 450: The AEW EDGE Performance Full System is custom-designed to fit the Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450, ensuring a perfect fit and seamless integration with your bike’s design. Product Specifications: Material: 304-grade stainless steel with a matt polish finish Exhaust Type: Full system (includes headers, mid-pipe, and slip-on) Sound: Medium tone thump Performance: Improved bottom to mid-range power, better throttle response, and smoother acceleration Fitment: Designed specifically for Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 Finish: Matt polish for a sleek, high-quality look Why Choose AEW Performance Full System Exhaust for Guerrilla 450? Maximum Performance: The full system exhaust is designed to optimize exhaust flow, providing greater power and smoother performance, especially in the bottom and mid-range. Bold Sound: Enjoy the bold, refined medium-tone thump that enhances the bike's overall presence and sound. Durable Construction: Made from 304-grade stainless steel, this exhaust system offers exceptional durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it will perform reliably for years to come. Sleek Aesthetic: The matt polish finish adds a stylish and aggressive look to your Guerrilla 450, making it stand out wherever you ride. Perfect Fit: Designed specifically for the Guerrilla 450, this full system exhaust provides an optimal fit with no modifications required. The AEW Performance Full System Exhaust for Guerrilla 450 is the perfect upgrade for riders looking to improve their bike’s performance, sound, and appearance. This full system exhaust is designed for maximum power with a free-flow design, providing a bold medium-tone thump and enhanced throttle response. Made from durable 304-grade stainless steel with a matt polish finish, it’s built to last and perfectly complements the design of your Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450. Whether you're after more power or a striking new sound, the AEW Performance Full System Exhaust is the ideal choice. Note: AEW Product Availability & Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 10-15 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once a order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-93007207892f:T1402,AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Mirror Polish - Interceptor /GT 650 AEW TE 102 Megaphone - Stainless Steel Mirror Polish is an upgraded exhaust silencer designed specifically for the Interceptor GT 650 and GT 650 models. This high-quality exhaust provides not only a boost in performance but also a sleek, shiny aesthetic that enhances the bike's look. Below are the key details of this product: Key Features: Slightly Fatter Construction: The TE 102 Megaphone is similar to the TE 101, but it features a slightly fatter construction, adding more presence to your bike. This gives it a more substantial and bold look. High-Quality Stainless Steel Mirror Polish: Fabricated from high-quality stainless steel, the TE 102 is finished with a mirror polish, giving it a bright, reflective surface that stands out and elevates your bike’s aesthetic appeal. Heat Shield for Enhanced Look: The TE 102 comes equipped with a heat shield that conceals the silencer mounts, improving the visual appeal by providing a cleaner, more finished appearance. Lightweight Sound Damping Insulation: The exhaust is fitted with lightweight sound-damping insulation, which helps reduce vibrations and enhances the overall sound quality, making it more refined and pleasant. Weight Reduction: The TE 102 reduces the bike's weight by 4.5 kg, contributing to a lighter and more agile bike that responds more quickly to throttle inputs and is easier to handle. Improved Bottom and Mid-Range Torque: This exhaust is designed to improve bottom and mid-range torque, offering better throttle response and smoother acceleration, particularly in lower to mid-rev ranges. Signature Rumble Sound: The TE 102 Megaphone is known for its signature rumble sound. The exhaust produces a deep, throaty tone that is especially noticeable when downshifting through gears or braking, adding to the overall riding experience. Removable DB Killer: The exhaust comes with an easily removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer, giving you the flexibility to adjust the exhaust’s sound output to your preference. You can have a quieter ride or let the bike roar, depending on your mood. Direct Fit, Slip-On Installation: The TE 102 is a direct fit and features a slip-on mounting system, making it incredibly ea