h adds a bold visual upgrade, ensuring your bike turns heads wherever you ride. Key Features: Premium 304-grade stainless steel construction Polished chrome (mirror finish) for a stylish look Improved performance and signature Jawa exhaust note Durable and corrosion-resistant Easy bolt-on installation Compatible With: Jawa FJ 42 What's in the Box: 1 Set of Silencers Mounting Clamps Keychain Installation Manual Experience the power, sound, and quality of the Red Rooster Celesta Pro Exhaust and unlock the full potential of your Jawa. Note: This is not compatible with Standard Jawa 42.33:T707,AEW-Classic 650 Performace Exhaust (Mirror Polish)-TE204 Experience the perfect blend of classic design and modern performance with the AEW TE204 Exhaust, crafted exclusively for the Royal Enfield Classic 650. This premium performance exhaust features a retro-inspired mirror-polished finish and is built using high-grade stainless steel, ensuring long-lasting durability and timeless style. The integrated heat shield smartly hides the silencer mounts, adding a clean, streamlined look to your bike. Weighing 6 kg lighter than the stock exhaust, the TE204 significantly improves your bike's agility, handling, and torque delivery in the bottom and mid RPM range—ideal for urban riding and spirited highway runs. Its slimmer profile sharpens your Classic 650’s lines, while the deep, signature rumble—especially noticeable during downshifts and braking—gives your ride a powerful auditory presence. Key Features: Premium stainless steel construction with mirror polish Lightweight build reduces overall bike weight by 6 kg Improved bottom and mid-range torque Retro-style design with integrated heat shield Direct slip-on fit for hassle-free installation Lifetime rust-proof warranty Removable stainless steel decibel (DB) killer Why Choose the AEW TE204: No cutting or welding required – plug-and-play installation Enhanced ride dynamics with better power delivery Aesthetically refined to match the Ro