llar exhaust, brace yourself for a surge in torque, an electrifying throttle response, and an impressive boost in horsepower across the entire rev range. Each twist of the throttle will be met with unmatched precision and exhilaration. But that’s not all – the Red Rooster Performance Exhaust doesn’t just enhance performance. It also adds a captivating and aggressive sporty thump, showcasing the true character of the Continental GT/ Interceptor 650’s parallel-twin engine. It’s more than just an upgrade; it’s an expression of pure adrenaline! Step up your riding game with the Red Rooster Performance Stellar Exhaust – where power, style, and the heart-pounding beat of the road converge into one thrilling symphony! Experience power at play with Red Rooster! Additional Information:- Weight (Kg) Length (cm) Breadth (cm) Height (cm) 8 64 39 1840:Ta5e,Red-Rooster Performance Stellar-X Exhaust-(Polish) For Bear-650 Command attention and conquer the road with the Stellar-X Exhaust by Red Rooster Performance — designed exclusively for the Bear 650. Crafted from aerospace-grade stainless steel and built for maximum performance and durability, the Stellar-X delivers a distinctive deep thump, enhanced throttle response, and up to 10% gains in power and torque. With bold styling, precision engineering, and effortless installation, this is more than just an exhaust — it’s your bike’s voice. Key Features:- Performance & Power:- Up to 10% Performance Gain in horsepower and torque Free-flow baffle system with optimized mandrel bends for superior exhaust flow No ECU remap required – plug-and-play setup Build Quality & Materials:- Made from aerospace-grade SS 304 stainless steel Polished finish for a sleek, premium look Imported 3B glass wool insulation ensures top-tier thermal control Next-Gen Thermal Shielding:- Built-in stitched blanket insulation reduces heat buildup Enhances riding comfort and reduces strain on the engine and components Lightweight Construction:- Weighs only 4.8 kg – nearly 50% lighter than stock exhaust Reduces overall load, improving handling and agility Signature Sound:- Produces a deep, aggressive thump that complements the Bear 650’s parallel-twin engine Includes DB Killer for refined tone and street-legality Installation & Compatibility:- Direct bolt-on fitment to original header (after removing stock catalytic converter) Compatible with BS6 emission standards No additional tuning or modifications required Eco-Friendly Engineering:- Delivers clean emissions while maximizing flow and sound Crafted for durability, rust-resistance, and long life Stellar-X Advantages:- Performance You Can Feel – Immediate improvements in throttle snap and mid-range pull Design That Stands Out – Aggressive silhouette with polished finish Trusted by Riders & Experts – Backed by Red Rooster’s reputation and a lifetime warranty on the exhaust body Built for the Growing 650cc Community – Perfect for Royal Enfield owners seeking serious upgrades Specifications:- Attribute Details Brand Red Rooster Performance Model Name Stellar-X (Polish) Vehicle Compatibility Royal Enfield Bear 650 (BS6) Material SS 304 Stainless Steel Insulation 3B Imported Glass Wool + Stitched Blanket Net Weight 4.8 kg Performance Gain Up to 10% (torque, horsepower, response) Compliance BS6 Compliant Sound Profile Deep, aggressive thump (with DB killer) Installation Direct-fit bolt-on (no remap needed) Country of Origin India Warranty Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body41:Ta56,Red-Rooster Performance Stellar-X Exhaust-(Matte) For Bear-650 Command attention and conquer the road with the Stellar-X Exhaust by Red Rooster Performance — designed exclusively for the Bear 650. Crafted from aerospace-grade stainless steel and built for maximum performance and durability, the Stellar-X delivers a distinctive deep thump, enhanced throttle response, and up to 10% gains in power and torque. With bold styling, precision engineering, and effortless installation, this is more than just an