htweight at 3.20 Kg to maintain the bike’s balance and handling. 4. Easy Installation: Plug & Play Install: Designed for easy installation, making it perfect for DIY enthusiasts or professional fitments. No Compromise on Comfort: Engineered to provide a seamless fit with zero compromise on ride quality . 5. Warranty & Durability: Lifetime Warranty: Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body, ensuring longevity and peace of mind. 36-Month Warranty on Insulation: Includes a 36-month warranty on the insulation blanket (T&C Apply). Specifications:- Feature Details Exhaust Type Slip-on Design Smooth Retro Finish Sound Smooth, Classy Thump with Depth Weight 3.20 Kg Material SS304 Stainless Steel Plug & Play Install Yes Warranty (Body) Lifetime Warranty (Insulation) 36 Months (T&C Apply) Red Rooster Performance Atlas Exhaust Benefits:- Designed for Royal Enfield Classic 650's DNA: Perfectly complements the bike’s design and performance. Balanced Performance & Aesthetic Appeal: Offers a boost in performance while maintaining a classy, retro aesthetic. Zero Compromise on Comfort: With a pillion-friendly design, no heat issues, and a smooth exhaust note, it ensures an enhanced ride quality. Backed by Engineering Excellence: The Red Rooster Performance brand is known for its commitment to quality, and this exhaust is engineered to last. Why Upgrade to Atlas Exhaust? Enhance your Royal Enfield Classic 650 with a premium exhaust system that delivers better performance, improved comfort, and a signature smooth exhaust note. Perfect for riders who demand both style and substance, without compromising on ride quality. Important Notes: Warranty: T&C Apply for the 36-month insulation warranty. Installation: Plug-and-play installation with no modifications required. Upgrade Your Ride Today! Choose Red Rooster Performance Atlas Exhaust (Matte) for Royal Enfield Classic 650 and experience superior performance, timeless design, and enhanced riding comfort. Elevate your bike’s performance while riding in style.44:Tccc,Red Rooster Performance Atlas Exhaust (Polish) For Royal Enfield Classic 650 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Classic 650 with the Red Rooster Performance Atlas Exhaust – a sleek, bold, and timeless exhaust designed to enhance both performance and aesthetics. Crafted to match the classic retro lines of the Classic 650, the Atlas exhaust delivers a superior exhaust note and improved ride quality while offering practical features like a pillion-friendly design and heat management. Key Features:- 1. Premium Performance & Design: Performance Gain: Up to 10% performance improvement . Pillion-Friendly Design: Comfort for both rider and pillion, with no heat issues, ensuring an enjoyable ride together. Sleek Retro Design: Matches the elegant retro lines of the Royal Enfield Classic 650. Smooth Finish: A Polish finish enhances the bike's aesthetic appeal. 2. Innovative Heat & Sound Management: Glass Wool Insulation: Made with premium 3B-imported glass wool insulation for optimal thermal efficiency. Sound Quality: Produces a smooth, classy thump with depth without harshness, creating a signature exhaust note. 3. Superior Build Quality: Material: Crafted from SS304 Stainless Steel for durability, rust resistance, and heat resistance. Weight: Lightweight at 3.20 Kg to maintain the bike’s balance and handling. 4. Easy Installation: Plug & Play Install: Designed for easy installation, making it perfect for DIY enthusiasts or professional fitments. No Compromise on Comfort: Engineered to provide a seamless fit with zero compromise on ride quality . 5. Warranty & Durability: Lifetime Warranty: Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body, ensuring longevity and peace of mind. 36-Month Warranty on Insulation: Includes a 36-month warranty on the insulation blanket (T&C Apply). Specifications:- Feature Details Exhaust Type Slip-on Design Smooth Retro Finish Sound Smooth, Classy Thump with Depth Weight 3.20 Kg Material SS304 Stainless Steel Plug & Play Install Yes Warrant