er ride. Optimal Thermal Efficiency ensures heat is properly managed, providing a safer and more comfortable riding experience. 5. Easy Installation & Long-Term Reliability: Plug & Play Installation: The Atlas Pro Exhaust is designed for easy, no-hassle installation Lifetime Warranty on Body: Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body, ensuring durability and peace of mind. Specifications:- Feature Details Exhaust Type Slip-on Design Rear Vented Finish Sound Deeper, Louder, Sportier with a Growl Weight 3.06 Kg Material SS304 Stainless Steel Plug & Play Install Yes Warranty (Body) Lifetime Red Rooster Performance Atlas Pro-Exhaust benefits:- Tailored for Performance and Aesthetics: Designed for the Royal Enfield Classic 650, this exhaust offers the perfect balance of performance and retro styling. Aggressive Sound & Design: With its deeper, sportier growl and vented rear finish, it stands out from the crowd, making your ride both thrilling and stylish. Comfort & Performance Without Compromise Featuring a pillion-friendly design, this exhaust ensures no heat issues and enhances comfort on long rides. Red Rooster Engineering Legacy Backed by years of performance engineering, this exhaust is built to last, providing both long-term durability and premium performance . Why Upgrade to Atlas Pro-Exhaust? Bold Performance: Achieve up to 10% performance gain when enhancing throttle response and overall bike power. Timeless Yet Bold Design: The vented rear holes provide a modern, aggressive look while still paying homage to the vintage aesthetic of the Classic 650. Enhanced Ride Comfort: Pillion-friendly, with no heat issues and a focus on rider comfort without sacrificing performance or sound quality. Important Notes:- Warrant: Lifetime warranty on the exhaust body. 36-month warranty on insulation material (T&C Apply). Installation: Plug-and-play installation makes it quick and easy to add the Atlas Pro exhaust to your bike. Upgrade Your Ride Today! Choose the Red Rooster Performa