XPulse character. For the XPulse 210, the POLARIS Slip-On comes paired with an RRP Connecting Pipe, delivering up to a 10% performance gain for a more responsive and engaging ride. Crafted from premium SS304 stainless steel, the POLARIS is built to resist rust and corrosion while ensuring long-lasting durability across all riding conditions. Backed by a lifetime warranty on the exhaust body, it’s designed for riders who demand both reliability and performance. The POLARIS features imported stitched insulation technology for advanced heat and sound management, producing a deep bass exhaust note while maintaining optimal thermal efficiency. Designed to blend seamlessly with the bike’s stock aesthetics, the POLARIS delivers a premium OEM-style fit and finish while significantly reducing weight compared to stock setups. Available in Polish, Matte, and Black finishes, the POLARIS transforms both the look and feel of your XPulse. Upgrade your Hero XPulse 210 with the Red Rooster Performance POLARIS Exhaust and experience the perfect balance of performance, sound, durability, and adventure-ready styling Key Features Deep, Throaty Sound Up to 5% Increase in Engine Performance Lightweight Build Rust-Free Durability Installation Easy bolt-on installation that fits straight onto your existing setup with no big changes needed MORE INFO - CLICK TO SEE5e:T702,Red Rooster Polaris Exhaust for Xpulse 210 - Black Introducing the Red Rooster Performance POLARIS Exhaust, engineered exclusively for the Hero XPulse 210 to enhance your adventure riding experience. Meticulously developed and rigorously tested, the POLARIS is built for real-world riding — delivering improved throttle response, enhanced mid-range performance, and a deeper, refined exhaust note that perfectly complements the XPulse character. For the XPulse 210, the POLARIS Slip-On comes paired with an RRP Connecting Pipe, delivering up to a 10% performance gain for a more responsive and engaging ride. Crafted from premium SS