 The stainless steel construction guarantees longevity and enhances the pipes’ resistance to corrosion and heat, making them a reliable addition to your Royal Enfield. Product Highlights: Performance Unleashed: Our Header Pipes redefine your bike’s potential, delivering an impressive surge in torque and horsepower, translating to an exhilarating riding experience. Unrestricted Flow: The free-flow design optimises exhaust gas movement, improving engine efficiency and enhancing overall performance. Stainless Steel Strength: Crafted from high-grade stainless steel, our Header Pipes combine strength, corrosion resistance, and heat resilience for lasting performance and aesthetics. Precision Engineering: Designed to fit the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT seamlessly, our Header Pipes guarantee a hassle-free installation process. Upgrade your ride with our Stainless Steel Header Pipes, a testament to our commitment to engineering excellence and performance enhancement. Experience the thrill of unrestricted power and transform your Royal Enfield into a force to be reckoned with. Don’t just ride – command the road. Upgrade today and witness the true potential of your bike. Disclaimer: Due to extended use and exposure to great engine temperatures, it is normal for the exhaust to gain a faint golden tint. Compatible with: Royal Enfield Continental GT 650 and Interceptor 650.What you get: 1 Set Header Pipe, Clamps, Keychain, Sticker, and Manual. Additional Information:- Weight (Kg) Length (cm) Breadth (cm) Height (cm) 7 88 42 1561:T548,Red Rooster Performance-ORION Performance Exhaust (Matte) for Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 Where Raw Torque Meets Polished Style. Engineered for thrill-seekers and style-driven riders, the ORION slip-on exhaust from Red Rooster Performance® is precision-built to unleash the full potential of your Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 and Himalayan 450. Key Features: Performance Boost: Up to 10% increase in engine output—torque and power you can feel with every twist. Premium Build: Made from SS304 stainless steel, ensuring unmatched durability, rust resistance, and heat tolerance. Sound Mastery: Deep, refined bass-rich tone for a signature roar that announces your arrival. Thermal Innovation: Fitted with an imported stitched insulation blanket for superior heat and sound management. No Hassle Fitment: Slip-on design—no ECU remap required. Design Highlights: Angular, aggressive styling that seamlessly complements the Guerrilla’s dual-sport DNA. Lightweight at just 2.75 kg, improving power-to-weight ratio and throttle response. Comparison Snapshot: Feature ORION Exhaust Stock/Other Exhausts Type Slip-on Slip-on Design Angular, Premium Routine Sound Deep & Refined Mild Thump Weight 2.75 Kg Above 5 Kg Thermal Insulation Stitched Blanket Basic Glass Wool Build Material SS304 Stainless Steel SS304 Stainless Steel Body Warranty Lifetime None62:T61a,Red Rooster Performance-Stellar Header Pipe For Royal Enfield GT 650 and Interceptor 650 (Black) Upgrade your Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 with the Red Rooster Performance Stellar Header Pipe – designed to deliver enhanced performance, aggressive sound, and long-lasting durability. Key Features: Deep, Throaty Exhaust Note: Experience a louder and richer exhaust sound that adds character to your ride without being overly harsh. Up to 10% Performance Boost: Engineered to improve exhaust flow, this header pipe can deliver up to 10% increase in overall engine performance. Lightweight Construction: Built with precision to reduce unnecessary weight, enhancing acceleration and overall handling. Corrosion-Resistant: Made using high-quality materials that offer excellent resistance to rust and high temperatures. Durable Black Finish: Comes with a 6-month warranty on the black-coated version. Polish and matte finish variants are backed by a lifetime warranty. Heat Discoloration Notice: A color change from golden-yellow to dark blue may appear on the header pipe due to heat exposure. This is a normal occurrence and does not affect performance or durability. It is not covered under warranty. Easy Installation: Designed for a direct bolt-on fitment with no major modifications required. Compatible with the stock exhaust setup of the Interceptor 650. Compatibility: Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 Also fit Continental GT 650 Boost your bike’s sound, performance, and style with the Red Rooster Stellar Header Pipe – built for riders who demand more.63:T576,Red Rooster Rumbler–Black Matte Exhaust for Royal Enfield Standard 500 Experience the perfect blend of power, durability, and iconic sound with the Red Rooster Rumbler Exhaust in a sleek Black Matte finish. Engineered for the Royal Enfield Thunderbird X 350, this high-performance exhaust enhances both style and functionality with up to 20% improved performance. Key Features: Performance Boost: Optimized design improves exhaust flow for up to 20% better engine output. Deep, Authentic Thump: Enhances the signature Royal Enfield sound for a more immersive ride. High-Quality Construction: Built with premium SS304 stainless steel for rust-free durability. Ceramic Wool Packing: Offers superior thermal resistance compared to conventional glass wool. Black Matte Finish: Sleek and rugged look that complements your bike’s design. Lifetime Material Warranty: Guaranteed quality for long-term peace of mind. What’s Included: 1 Exhaust Silencer Mounting Clamps Keychain Sticker Installation Manual Compatible With: Royal Enfield Thunderbird X 350 Royal Enfield Classic 350/500 (Pre-2021) Royal Enfield Bullet 350/500 (Pre-2023) Royal Enfield Thunderbird 350/500 Why Choose the Black Matte Rumbler? Designed for riders who prefer a stealthy, bold look along with reliable performance, this exhaust system delivers powerful sound, increased efficiency, and standout style for your Royal Enfield.64:T8e9,AKRAPOVIC SUZUKI GSX-R 1000 2019Optional Header (SS)PART NUMBER: E-S10R6 Power +7.1 kW at 8950 rpm Torque +8.7 Nm at 7550 rpm Weight -3.1 kg This option upgrades the Slip-On Line muffler to a full, complete system. It is made from perfectly welded stainless steel tubes. It improves sound when used in conjunction with the Slip-On Line (Carbon) to produce a true sporty tone, and when fitted to the Slip-On Line (Titanium) it delivers a racing sound that will certainly be noticed and appreciated. Power and torque are improved through the whole rev range. When mounting the optional headers to the EC/ECE type-approved Slip-On Line (Carbon) exhaust system, the EC/ECE type approval is no longer valid. For perfect performance, throttle response, and durability, special mapping developed by Akrapovič R&D in collaboration with our partner Rapid Bike by Dimsport has to be used. Please visit ﻿https://www.dimsport.us/en/rapid-bike/akrapovic/﻿ , where you can download the mapping. ﻿THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 134.6 / 13050 137.6 / 13100 + 7.1 / 8950 HP (m) 182.9 / 13050 187.0 / 13100 + 9.6 / 8950 HP (i) 180.4 / 13050 184.5 / 13100 + 9.5 / 8950 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 110.1 / 11000 112.6 / 10750 + 8.7 / 7550 Ib-ft 81.2 / 11000 83.0 / 10750 + 6.4 / 7550 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 7.2 4.1 - 3.1 Ib 15.9 9.0 - 6.9 % - 43.1 UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Noise DB 98 / 6600 105.6 / 5500 7.6 Inst. time MIN 240 Measured with: Suzuki GSX-R 1000 2017 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be handled by manufacturer directly under official India Channel partner.65:T81e,AKRAPOVIC SUZUKI GSX-R 1000 2019Slip-On Line (Titanium)PART NUMBER: S-S10SO13-CUBT Power +1.8 kW at 13100 rpm Torque +2.1 Nm at 9000 rpm Weight -2.3 kg Constructed from high-grade ultra-lightweight titanium, this system provides an over 70% weight savings compared to the stock muffler. It is small and sporty, with a Grand Prix–inspired design, delivering increases in power and torque throughout the rpm curve. The stunning sound gives a real sense of racing and total exhilaration. The simple plug-and-play installation means there is no need for remapping. It is designed for track use and markets where EC/ECE type approval is not required. There are optional headers for improved torque and power in mid and high rev range. If used with optional headers, remapping is needed. THIS PRODUCT DOES NOT MEET EMISSION COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS FOR STREET OR HIGHWAY USE. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 134.6 / 13050 136.2 / 13100 + 1.8 / 13100 HP (m) 182.9 / 13050 185.1 / 13100 + 2.4 / 13100 HP (i) 180.4 / 13050 182.6 / 13100 + 2.4 / 13100 MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 110.1 / 11000 111.3 / 11000 + 2.1 / 9000 Ib-ft 81.2 / 11000 82.1 / 11000 + 1.5 / 9000 Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.2 1.0 - 2.3 Ib 7.1 2.1 - 5.0 % - 70.3 UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Noise DB 98 / 6600 112.8 / 6600 14.8 Inst. time MIN 20 Measured with: Suzuki GSX-R 1000 2017 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's