muffler inner structure are all made from stainless steel. It is finished with a monochrome logo sticker and a heatshield to prevent burning or damage to the rider’s gear. During the development stage, emphasis was placed on throttle response and performance. It delivers increases in power and torque of 0.7 kW (0.9 hp) at 8,000 rpm and 1.0 Nm at 8,000 rpm, respectively, when compared to a Triumph equipped with a standard stock exhaust system and tested on the Akrapovič in-house dyno. Lightweight materials create a weight reduction of 39.5% (1.3 kg) against the standard stock system. This product has a deep and full sound. It is EC/ECE type approved and Euro5 compliant, and the straightforward plug-and-play installation means no remapping is needed. TECHNICAL DATA MAX POWER: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM KW 26.1 / 8000 rpm 26.4 / 8000 rpm + 0.7 / 8000 rpm HP (m) 35.5 / 8000 rpm 35.9 / 8000 rpm + 0.9 / 8000 rpm HP (i) 35 / 8000 rpm 35.4 / 8000 rpm + 0.9 / 8000 rpm MAX TORQUE: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Nm 33.1 / 7000 rpm 33.7 / 6600 rpm + 1 / 6700 rpm Ib-ft 24.4 / 7000 rpm 24.9 / 6600 rpm + 0.7 / 6700 rpm Weight: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM kg 3.29 1.99 - 1.3 Ib 7.3 4.4 - 2.9 % - 39.5 Inst Time: UNIT STOCKRPM AKRAPOVIČRPM MAX GAINRPM Min 20 Documents: Schematic New Version: View Installation Instructions: View Installation Instructions: View Performance Graph: View AUS Approval: View AUS Approval: View ECE Type-Approval Certificate: View ECE Type-Approval Certificate: View IMPORTANT NOTE: AKRAPOVIC PRODUCTS WILL SHIP OUT in 3-5 BUSINESS DAYS. KINDLY CONFIRM WITH US ON EMAIL / WATSAPP BEFORE PLACING AN ORDER. Images shown for illustration purpose only. Actual product may vary in finish, specifications, look without any discretion from manufacturer. Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. AKRAPOVIC products do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements. All claims for warranty to be hand