Hunter350 Free Flow Exhaust Mild Steel Black - 89200 The AEW Short Megaphone silencer is another of our ever-popular, short-length, free-flow silencers tailor-made for Royal Enfield Hunter 350 bikes. It uses ceramic wool and a purpose-made smaller-diameter outlet to produce a distinctive, loud, and throaty thump. The Megaphone also works to improve mid-range power delivery and maintains the stock look of your Hunter 350. Note: AEW Product Availability & Shipping Information Please be advised that AEW products are made to order sometimes so dispatch may take 15-20 days Ready Stock: If the product is currently in stock, it will be shipped within 2-3 business days. Once an order is placed, it cannot be canceled, and payments are non-refundable. For inquiries regarding product availability or estimated delivery timelines, please contact our sales team: 📞 Phone: +91-8962258899 / +91-9300720789\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"4500.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/AEW-Hunter350-Free-Flow-Exhaust-Mild-Steel-Black-89200-1.jpg?v=1787335438\",\"altText\":\"AEW Hunter350 Free Flow Exhaust Mild Steel Black - 89200\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/AEW-Hunter350-Free-Flow-Exhaust-Mild-Steel-Black-89200-2.jpg?v=1787335438\",\"altText\":\"AEW Hunter350 Free Flow Exhaust Mild Steel Black - 89200\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/AEW-Hunter350-Free-Flow-Exhaust-Mild-Steel-Black-89200-3.jpg?v=1787335438\",\"altText\":\"AEW Hunter350 Free Flow Exhaust Mild Steel Black - 89200\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52911706800445\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"4500.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"5500.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"AEW\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[\"n